{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d67508f1", "timestamp": "2026-12-24T22:20:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about unauthorized access to action history has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ActionGenie/pull/37.", "utterranceID": "20261224-0-e7e55"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-0-e7e55"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4afd9484", "timestamp": "2026-12-24T22:25:00", "text": "Great news, Bob! Can you explain what caused the issue?", "utterranceID": "20261224-1-7a176"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-1-7a176"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_234b3360", "timestamp": "2027-02-19T11:32:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about concurrency issues in the task assignment logic has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ActionGenie/pull/46.", "utterranceID": "20270219-0-b6333"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270219-0-b6333"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_234b3360", "timestamp": "2027-02-19T11:37:00", "text": "The root cause was that the task assignment logic wasn't handling concurrent requests properly, leading to race conditions. This caused delays and inconsistencies in task assignments.", "utterranceID": "20270219-1-c5510"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270219-1-c5510"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_234b3360", "timestamp": "2027-02-19T11:42:00", "text": "To fix it, I implemented a locking mechanism using a mutex to ensure that only one request can modify the task state at a time. This should prevent any race conditions and ensure consistent task processing.", "utterranceID": "20270219-2-f7310"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270219-2-f7310"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e96d2f38", "timestamp": "2027-02-19T11:43:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_234b3360! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. I'll review the PR shortly.", "utterranceID": "20270219-3-ca577"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270219-3-ca577"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_08841d48", "timestamp": "2027-02-19T11:48:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian Davis! This should really help with the task processing delays we've been seeing.", "utterranceID": "20270219-4-d62b4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270219-4-d62b4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8c5414f1", "timestamp": "2027-02-19T11:49:00", "text": "Nice job, Ian! Let me know if there's anything else you need from my end to get this deployed.", "utterranceID": "20270219-5-dd2b8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270219-5-dd2b8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_234b3360", "timestamp": "2027-02-19T11:53:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! @eid_8c5414f1, I'll let you know if anything comes up. For now, just a review from @eid_e96d2f38 would be great.", "utterranceID": "20270219-6-2c426"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270219-6-2c426"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_08841d48", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T19:53:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Exposure of Sensitive Data in Error Messages' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ActionGenie/pull/47.", "utterranceID": "20270222-0-dc003"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270222-0-dc003"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8c5414f1", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T19:57:00", "text": "Great news, Ian! Can you explain what caused the issue?", "utterranceID": "20270222-1-0e989"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270222-1-0e989"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_08841d48", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T20:02:00", "text": "Sure, Bob. The root cause was improper handling of error responses in the API. Specifically, the error messages were returning detailed stack traces that included sensitive information.", "utterranceID": "20270222-2-f009f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270222-2-f009f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f73462f7", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T20:07:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Ian. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270222-3-fd248"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270222-3-fd248"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_08841d48", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T20:12:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I updated the error handling mechanism to sanitize error messages. Now, the API only returns generic error messages without any sensitive details. This should prevent any potential exploitation by attackers.", "utterranceID": "20270222-4-300c0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270222-4-300c0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e96d2f38", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T20:17:00", "text": "Nice work, Ian! This should definitely improve our security posture. Thanks for handling it so swiftly.", "utterranceID": "20270222-5-328fd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270222-5-328fd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_08841d48", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T20:19:00", "text": "Thanks, David. If anyone has further questions or needs more details, feel free to reach out.", "utterranceID": "20270222-6-ecc54"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270222-6-ecc54"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8c5414f1", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T20:21:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian. I'll review the changes and let you know if I have any questions.", "utterranceID": "20270222-7-ed658"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270222-7-ed658"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4afd9484", "timestamp": "2026-12-15T12:19:00", "text": "Great, Bob! Next, we have a Django issue called 'Improper Permission Checks on Admin Actions'. This one is about admin actions being executed without verifying user permissions, similar to our 'Improper Validation of User Permissions'. Here's the link: https://github.com/django/django/pull/15", "utterranceID": "20261215-3-c8210"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261215-3-c8210"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8175da95", "timestamp": "2026-12-15T12:21:00", "text": "This sounds like a perfect match for our permissions validation issue. I'll dive into their PR and see if there's anything we can leverage for our fix. Thanks for sharing, Emma! 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20261215-4-ed6f6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261215-4-ed6f6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4afd9484", "timestamp": "2026-12-15T12:23:00", "text": "Awesome, Fiona! Lastly, we have a TensorFlow issue titled 'Encoding Errors with UTF-8 Text'. Their models are failing to process UTF-8 encoded text correctly, which is similar to our 'Encoding Issues with Non-Latin Scripts'. Here's the link: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/16", "utterranceID": "20261215-5-7205c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261215-5-7205c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_21de287d", "timestamp": "2026-12-15T12:24:00", "text": "Thanks, Emma! I'll take a look at how TensorFlow is handling their encoding issues. It might give us some insights into fixing our NLP Model & Language Processing problems. 🌐", "utterranceID": "20261215-6-06591"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261215-6-06591"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4afd9484", "timestamp": "2026-12-15T12:25:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep these open-source solutions in mind as we work on our fixes. Feel free to reach out if you need any more info or help. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261215-7-f392b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261215-7-f392b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d67508f1", "timestamp": "2026-12-15T12:29:00", "text": "Will do! I'll update once I have more details on the unauthorized access issue. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261215-8-6a676"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261215-8-6a676"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8175da95", "timestamp": "2026-12-15T12:32:00", "text": "Same here, I'll keep you posted on the permissions issue. 👌", "utterranceID": "20261215-9-2a7be"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261215-9-2a7be"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_21de287d", "timestamp": "2026-12-15T12:34:00", "text": "I'll make sure to provide updates on the encoding fix as well. Thanks, team! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261215-10-a3ec9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261215-10-a3ec9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d5888f27", "timestamp": "2026-12-18T00:11:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Memory Leak in Task Processing Module' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ActionGenie/pull/36.", "utterranceID": "20261217-0-cbb69"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-0-cbb69"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4afd9484", "timestamp": "2026-12-18T00:16:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_d5888f27! Can you explain what was causing the memory leak?", "utterranceID": "20261217-1-396e0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-1-396e0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d5888f27", "timestamp": "2026-12-18T00:19:00", "text": "Sure, Emma. The root cause was improper memory management in the task processing module. Specifically, memory allocated for task data wasn't being released after the tasks were processed, which led to a gradual increase in memory usage and system slowdown.", "utterranceID": "20261217-2-5264b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-2-5264b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d1169926", "timestamp": "2026-12-18T00:24:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Bob Miller. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261217-3-eb411"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-3-eb411"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d5888f27", "timestamp": "2026-12-18T00:26:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I implemented a more efficient memory management strategy. I added a garbage collection routine that ensures memory is properly released after each task is processed. This prevents the accumulation of unused memory and keeps the system running smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20261217-4-c2b8e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-4-c2b8e"}

