### Changes Made
- Refactored the dependency analysis algorithm to accurately trace API component interdependencies.
- Updated the logic to ensure correct identification of critical endpoints.
- Added unit tests to verify the accuracy of the dependency maps.

### Testing
- Conducted unit tests to validate the new algorithm against various API flow scenarios.
- Performed integration testing to ensure the overall system stability and correctness of the dependency maps.

This fix ensures that users receive accurate information about API flow dependencies, improving the reliability of the FlowForce tool.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/FlowForce/pull/40", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "True", "number": "40", "state": "closed", "user": {"login": "eid_8605f7ee"}, "created_at": "2026-10-10T00:38:00", "reviews": [{"state": "APPROVED", "user": {"login": "eid_e5e36dc1"}, "comment": "Looks great! The changes effectively address the issue with the dependency mapping. I have reviewed the code and tested the scenarios, and everything works as expected. Approved.", "submitted_at": "2026-10-10T00:38:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_FlowForce_pull_40"}
