{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-08T22:36:00", "text": "Hi team, I found some interesting open-source bugs that might help us with our current issues. Let's take a look at them! 😊", "utterranceID": "20270108-0-8709b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270108-0-8709b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-08T22:37:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue in the OAuth2 Proxy project titled 'Incorrect Scope Handling in OAuth Flow'. It seems similar to our 'Incorrect Scope Assignment' problem. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/oauth2-proxy/oauth2-proxy/pull/1955. @eid_5782059f, could you check this out and see if there are any insights we can apply to our API Authentication Module?", "utterranceID": "20270108-1-63aeb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270108-1-63aeb"}
