{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-13T05:59:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Faulty Hyperparameter Configuration' issue. The problem is with incorrect hyperparameter settings during model updates, which is affecting the Model Management & Update Module. This is impacting Customer CUST-0019, and it could lead to inaccurate predictions. @eid_2347b567, this one's for you. Can you take a look? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20270112-1-825e1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270112-1-825e1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-13T06:03:00", "text": "Thanks for the heads-up! I'll dive into the hyperparameter settings and see what's causing the issue. I'll keep you posted on my progress. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270112-2-91774"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270112-2-91774"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-13T06:06:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Weak API Authentication' issue. The API for managing AI models lacks robust authentication, which is a big security risk, especially for Customer CUST-0088. This affects the Security & Access Control area. @eid_2347b567, can you handle this one as well? 🔐", "utterranceID": "20270112-3-af3dc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270112-3-af3dc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-13T06:10:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll prioritize strengthening the API authentication mechanisms. Security is crucial, and I'll ensure we address this promptly. 🔒", "utterranceID": "20270112-4-5c1f8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270112-4-5c1f8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-13T06:11:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's a 'Vulnerable Edge Device Firmware' issue. The firmware on edge devices has vulnerabilities that could be exploited, impacting Customer CUST-0076. This is also in the Security & Access Control area. @eid_2347b567, you're on a roll today! Can you tackle this one too? 🛡️", "utterranceID": "20270112-5-e9210"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270112-5-e9210"}
