{"title": "Enhance NLP Component to Correctly Interpret Domain-Specific Keywords", "summary": "### Summary of the Issue
The AI model was misinterpreting certain keywords or phrases, resulting in irrelevant search results being prioritized over more relevant ones. This was due to limitations in the NLP component's ability to understand domain-specific jargon or context-specific phrases.

### Changes Made
- Updated the NLP model to include a more comprehensive understanding of domain-specific keywords and context-specific phrases.
- Enhanced the weighting mechanism to prioritize relevant search results based on improved keyword interpretation.
- Added additional training data to cover a wider range of domain-specific language.

### Testing
- Conducted unit tests to ensure the updated NLP component correctly interprets and prioritizes keywords.
- Performed integration tests to verify that search results are now more relevant and accurately reflect user queries.
- Reviewed test cases to confirm that the fix addresses the root cause without introducing new issues.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/SearchFlow/pull/50", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "True", "number": "50", "state": "closed", "user": {"login": "eid_e01a396c"}, "created_at": "2026-09-12T09:41:00", "reviews": [{"state": "APPROVED", "user": {"login": "eid_3bcf2a20"}, "comment": "The changes look great! The updated NLP component effectively addresses the keyword misinterpretation issue, and the testing confirms improved search result relevance. Approved for merge.", "submitted_at": "2026-09-12T08:03:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_SearchFlow_pull_50"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-02-10T17:46:00", "text": "The algorithm is designed to cast a wide net to ensure comprehensive search results, which can sometimes include broader synonym sets.", "utterranceID": "20270210-3-1eea0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270210-3-1eea0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-02-10T17:49:00", "text": "This approach helps in scenarios where users might use less common synonyms, ensuring they still get relevant results.", "utterranceID": "20270210-4-44853"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270210-4-44853"}
