{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-02-10T17:56:00", "text": "Correct, @eid_7db4431d. No changes are necessary. I did a thorough check to confirm that the algorithm is functioning as intended.", "utterranceID": "20270210-6-991ad"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270210-6-991ad"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2027-02-10T18:00:00", "text": "Got it, David Garcia. Should we communicate this to the users to prevent future confusion?", "utterranceID": "20270210-7-493a2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270210-7-493a2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-02-10T18:04:00", "text": "Yes, @eid_d0b6cb92, that's a good idea. We can update the user documentation to clarify how the synonym expansion works and why it might include broader results.", "utterranceID": "20270210-8-c9a07"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270210-8-c9a07"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7db4431d", "timestamp": "2027-02-10T18:08:00", "text": "I'll draft a note for the documentation team to include this clarification. Thanks for the investigation, David.", "utterranceID": "20270210-9-e8b12"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270210-9-e8b12"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-02-10T18:09:00", "text": "No problem, David Jones. Let me know if there's anything else you need from me.", "utterranceID": "20270210-10-fdd41"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270210-10-fdd41"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2027-02-13T09:59:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SearchForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270212-0-b9fdd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-0-b9fdd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2027-02-13T10:00:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Entity Recognition Failure in Ambiguous Queries'. The NLP Engine is struggling to identify and differentiate entities in ambiguous queries, leading to irrelevant search results. This is impacting customer CUST-0070, and it's crucial we resolve this to prevent user frustration. @eid_160fca3c, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20270212-1-d2306"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-1-d2306"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-02-13T10:02:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the NLP Engine and see what's causing the entity recognition failure. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270212-2-00ae6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-2-00ae6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2027-02-13T10:06:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have an 'Incorrect Flexbox Implementation' issue. The layout management on the search results page is causing elements to overlap or misalign on mobile devices, affecting customer CUST-0003. This is impacting the User Interface (UI). @eid_160fca3c, you're also on this one.", "utterranceID": "20270212-3-d3be6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-3-d3be6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-02-13T10:10:00", "text": "Understood! I'll check the Flexbox implementation and make sure the UI is responsive on mobile devices. Let's get this sorted for CUST-0003. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270212-4-2919e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-4-2919e"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-86f5ca"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_04a698e5", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T23:21:00", "text": "On it! I'll work on adjusting the pipeline to better handle feedback drift. Let's keep our models sharp and relevant! 🔧", "utterranceID": "20261227-6-faff2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261227-6-faff2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-86f5ca"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_35e32fec", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T23:23:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep the communication open. If you need any more details or run into issues, just shout. Let's get these resolved and keep our customers happy! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261227-7-a9ab6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261227-7-a9ab6"}
