{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionajones-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-69f871"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_52681a26", "timestamp": "2027-01-04T20:51:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Inconsistent Data Mapping'. KnowledgeForce is failing to map data fields correctly during integration with external data sources. This affects the Data Sync & Integration Module and could lead to critical information loss for CUST-0061. @eid_91821de8, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20270104-1-30881"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270104-1-30881"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionajones-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-69f871"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91821de8", "timestamp": "2027-01-04T20:56:00", "text": "Got it! I'll start looking into the data mapping issue right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270104-2-b35ef"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270104-2-b35ef"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionajones-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-69f871"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_52681a26", "timestamp": "2027-01-04T21:00:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Incorrect Data Transformation'. The data transformations during integration are resulting in incorrect formats, affecting the same module. This is impacting CUST-0036. @eid_3338c2ad, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270104-3-72fac"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270104-3-72fac"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e1e5b3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-02-07T01:17:00", "text": "Thanks, David. I'll reach out if I need any assistance. For now, I'll proceed with updating the docs.", "utterranceID": "20270206-10-13577"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270206-10-13577"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e1e5b3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_14a5889d", "timestamp": "2027-02-09T09:11:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Memory Leak in Query Cache Management' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/KnowledgeForce/pull/43.", "utterranceID": "20270209-0-4ac6c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270209-0-4ac6c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e1e5b3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2542cff3", "timestamp": "2027-02-09T09:16:00", "text": "Great news, Charlie! Can you explain what was causing the memory leak?", "utterranceID": "20270209-1-c70d2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270209-1-c70d2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e1e5b3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_14a5889d", "timestamp": "2027-02-09T09:18:00", "text": "Sure thing, @eid_2542cff3. The root cause was that our cache management system wasn't implementing effective eviction policies. This led to stale data accumulating over time, causing memory exhaustion and degraded performance.", "utterranceID": "20270209-2-1d3b2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270209-2-1d3b2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e1e5b3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-02-09T09:20:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Charlie. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270209-3-7610b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270209-3-7610b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e1e5b3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_14a5889d", "timestamp": "2027-02-09T09:23:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I implemented a Least Recently Used (LRU) eviction policy. This ensures that the least accessed data is evicted first, keeping the cache size under control and preventing memory leaks.", "utterranceID": "20270209-4-2a5fd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270209-4-2a5fd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e1e5b3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-02-09T09:28:00", "text": "Nice work, Charlie! That should definitely help with the performance issues we've been seeing.", "utterranceID": "20270209-5-1d85c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270209-5-1d85c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e1e5b3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_14a5889d", "timestamp": "2027-02-09T09:31:00", "text": "Thanks, George. I've also added some monitoring to track cache usage patterns, so we can catch any similar issues early in the future.", "utterranceID": "20270209-6-b079f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270209-6-b079f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e1e5b3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-02-09T09:35:00", "text": "That's a solid plan. Thanks for the quick turnaround on this, Charlie!", "utterranceID": "20270209-7-3fc0f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270209-7-3fc0f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e1e5b3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2542cff3", "timestamp": "2027-02-09T09:37:00", "text": "Agreed. Thanks for the hard work, Charlie. This should make a big difference.", "utterranceID": "20270209-8-e65a2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270209-8-e65a2"}

