{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-10-26T09:06:00", "text": "This is spot on, Ian! The Electron issue with background tasks consuming too many resources is just like what we're seeing. I'll dive into their approach and see if we can optimize our resource management similarly. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261026-4-138be"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261026-4-138be"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-10-26T09:07:00", "text": "Awesome, Hannah! Lastly, there's a PostgreSQL bug about data corruption in concurrent writes. Sounds a lot like our Lead Database issue. Here's the PR: https://github.com/postgres/postgres/pull/627. Can you take a look at this one too?", "utterranceID": "20261026-5-fa203"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261026-5-fa203"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-10-26T09:12:00", "text": "Sure thing, Ian! The concurrent write operations causing data corruption in PostgreSQL could definitely give us some clues. I'll review their fix and see how we can apply it to our database operations. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20261026-6-f6906"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261026-6-f6906"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-10-26T09:16:00", "text": "Thanks, team! Let's use these insights to tackle our issues effectively. If you find anything particularly useful, let's discuss it further. Keep me posted on your progress! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261026-7-b4b11"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261026-7-b4b11"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-10-26T09:20:00", "text": "Will do, Ian! Thanks for finding these resources. Let's get to work! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261026-8-081f9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261026-8-081f9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-10-26T09:24:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's make sure our fixes are as robust as possible. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261026-9-949af"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261026-9-949af"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T17:35:00", "text": "@eid_99835861, I addressed the issue by updating our model retraining schedule. Now, the model will be retrained every two weeks to ensure it captures any shifts in lead behavior. Additionally, I implemented a monitoring system to alert us if feature drift is detected in the future.", "utterranceID": "20261001-4-17ab6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261001-4-17ab6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T17:38:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid plan, Ian. Thanks for taking care of this so quickly!", "utterranceID": "20261001-5-fdaf3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261001-5-fdaf3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T17:41:00", "text": "Agreed, thanks Ian. This should help us maintain more accurate lead scores moving forward.", "utterranceID": "20261001-6-6162f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261001-6-6162f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T17:46:00", "text": "No problem, glad to help! Let me know if you notice any other issues.", "utterranceID": "20261001-7-dd59f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261001-7-dd59f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:46:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect export permissions has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/47.", "utterranceID": "20261003-0-a2f3f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-0-a2f3f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:48:00", "text": "Great news, Ian! Can you explain what caused the issue?", "utterranceID": "20261003-1-63e1e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-1-63e1e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:53:00", "text": "Sure, Hannah. The root cause was a misconfiguration in the export module's permission settings. It was granting users excessive data access rights, allowing them to export more data than they were authorized to access.", "utterranceID": "20261003-2-8c05b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-2-8c05b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:55:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, @eid_9f4e2c6f. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261003-3-808cf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-3-808cf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:56:00", "text": "I updated the permission settings in the export module to correctly map user roles to their respective data access levels. This ensures that users can only export data they are authorized to access. We also added additional checks to validate permissions before any export action is performed.", "utterranceID": "20261003-4-02377"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-4-02377"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T06:01:00", "text": "Sounds like a solid fix. Thanks for handling this so quickly, Ian!", "utterranceID": "20261003-5-d94e9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-5-d94e9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T06:06:00", "text": "Yes, thanks @eid_9f4e2c6f. I'll make sure to test it thoroughly to ensure everything is working as expected.", "utterranceID": "20261003-6-b83f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-6-b83f5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T06:09:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian. Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing.", "utterranceID": "20261003-7-ebf31"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-7-ebf31"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-10-13T03:26:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with LeadForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261013-0-104eb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-0-104eb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-10-13T03:27:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Data Type Mismatch in Lead Attributes'. This is affecting our Database Management System and causing errors in lead scoring algorithms. Impacted customer is CUST-0040. @eid_c39dc658, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261013-1-1d019"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-1-1d019"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-10-13T03:32:00", "text": "Got it! I'll start looking into the data type mismatch issue right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261013-2-0952b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-2-0952b"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T20:04:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Bias in Training Data Skews Lead Scores'. The AI model is trained on a dataset with inherent biases, leading to skewed lead scores. This affects the AI Scoring Algorithm and impacts Customer CUST-0006. @eid_207da0e7, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20261008-1-64c2b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-1-64c2b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_207da0e7", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T20:09:00", "text": "Got it, I'll dive into the training data and see how we can mitigate these biases. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261008-2-721dd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-2-721dd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T20:12:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Incorrect Lead Scoring Due to Data Mismatch'. The AI model assigns incorrect scores when there's a mismatch between the historical data schema and the current input data format. This also affects the AI Scoring Algorithm and impacts Customer CUST-0037. @eid_a43a4389, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261008-3-4a17d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-3-4a17d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T20:14:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll check the data schemas and ensure they align correctly. Let's get those scores back on track! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261008-4-8fa38"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-4-8fa38"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T20:17:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, we have 'UI Freezes During Bulk Lead Import'. The UI becomes unresponsive during large imports, affecting the User Interface and impacting Customer CUST-0040. @eid_90359c89, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20261008-5-83551"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-5-83551"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_90359c89", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T20:19:00", "text": "On it! I'll look into optimizing the import process to keep the UI responsive. Thanks for assigning this to me! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261008-6-c1d0c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-6-c1d0c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T20:23:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep our customers happy and resolve these issues ASAP. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or additional info. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261008-7-9b71c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-7-9b71c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_207da0e7", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T20:28:00", "text": "Will do! Let's get to work. 💼", "utterranceID": "20261008-8-e977c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-8-e977c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T20:29:00", "text": "Thanks, team! Let's make it happen. 💪", "utterranceID": "20261008-9-25d1e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-9-25d1e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_90359c89", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T20:33:00", "text": "Thanks, all! Let's fix these bugs! 🐛", "utterranceID": "20261008-10-c41a9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-10-c41a9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T00:46:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might give us insights into our current issues. Let's take a look! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261010-0-86f13"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261010-0-86f13"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T00:48:00", "text": "First up, we have a bug in TensorFlow titled 'Bias in Model Predictions'. It deals with models trained on biased datasets, leading to skewed predictions. Sounds familiar, right? Here's the PR link: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/617. @eid_207da0e7, any thoughts on this?", "utterranceID": "20261010-1-2301d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261010-1-2301d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_207da0e7", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T00:53:00", "text": "Definitely relevant! The bias issue in TensorFlow is quite similar to what we're seeing with LeadForce. I'll review their approach to mitigating bias and see if we can apply any of their strategies. Thanks for sharing! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261010-2-5e833"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261010-2-5e833"}

