{"Channel": {"name": "planning-PersonalizeForce-PM", "channelID": "ch-ix-pm-1c1e2c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a253c65a", "timestamp": "2026-05-19T17:32:00", "text": "👍 Sounds like a solid product overall. We should definitely keep an eye on how they evolve. Thanks for the insights, Julia!", "utterranceID": "20260724-9-2a1aa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260724-9-2a1aa"}
