{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T12:26:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the sentiment analysis engine misinterpreting certain emojis, specifically the 'smiling face with smiling eyes' emoji being read as negative.", "utterranceID": "20261011-0-8279d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261011-0-8279d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T12:31:00", "text": "After reviewing the bug, I've determined that it does not require a fix. The sentiment analysis algorithm is functioning as designed.", "utterranceID": "20261011-1-70eb9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261011-1-70eb9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T12:35:00", "text": "The root cause is that the algorithm lacks comprehensive emoji context mapping, which can lead to misclassification. However, this is an expected limitation given the dual meanings of some emojis.", "utterranceID": "20261011-2-95371"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261011-2-95371"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T12:37:00", "text": "I verified this by cross-referencing our emoji sentiment mapping with industry standards, and it aligns with typical interpretations.", "utterranceID": "20261011-3-491c1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261011-3-491c1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T12:40:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Bob. So, it's more of a limitation than a bug?", "utterranceID": "20261011-4-b70f7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261011-4-b70f7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T12:43:00", "text": "Exactly, @eid_d96fb219. It's a known limitation of sentiment analysis algorithms when dealing with emojis that have dual meanings.", "utterranceID": "20261011-5-22616"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261011-5-22616"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T12:47:00", "text": "Got it, Bob. Should we document this somewhere for future reference?", "utterranceID": "20261011-6-01cdd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261011-6-01cdd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T12:50:00", "text": "Good idea, Fiona. I'll update the documentation to reflect this limitation, so it's clear for anyone reviewing the sentiment analysis capabilities.", "utterranceID": "20261011-7-97807"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261011-7-97807"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T12:52:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob. That should help manage expectations around emoji interpretations.", "utterranceID": "20261011-8-4addf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261011-8-4addf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T12:53:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone. Let me know if there's anything else I can assist with!", "utterranceID": "20261011-9-13194"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261011-9-13194"}
