{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:19:00", "text": "Absolutely, Charlie! This is quite similar to what we're seeing with SentimentForce. I'll review their approach and see if we can apply any of their solutions to our Real-Time Dashboard. Thanks for sharing! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261019-2-e3d26"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-2-e3d26"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:24:00", "text": "Great! Next up, we have a 'Token Expiry Misconfiguration' in OAuth2 Proxy. Their access tokens aren't expiring as expected, which is a security risk. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/oauth2-proxy/oauth2-proxy/pull/172. David, this seems to align with our token expiry issue. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20261019-3-a4a66"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-3-a4a66"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:29:00", "text": "Yes, Charlie, this is very relevant! I'll dive into their PR to see how they tackled the token expiry problem. It might give us some insights for our User Authentication Module. Security first! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20261019-4-d805d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-4-d805d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:30:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks David! Lastly, there's a 'Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) in Comment Section' vulnerability in WordPress. Attackers can inject scripts in the comment section, which is similar to our login page issue. Here's the PR: https://github.com/WordPress/WordPress/pull/173. Can you also take a look at this one?", "utterranceID": "20261019-5-992e5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-5-992e5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:31:00", "text": "Sure thing, Charlie! I'll review their fix for the XSS vulnerability and see if we can apply similar measures to secure our login page. 🛡️", "utterranceID": "20261019-6-13d2b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-6-13d2b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:33:00", "text": "Thanks, David! Let's keep these open-source solutions in mind as we work on our bugs. If you need any help or want to discuss further, just ping me. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261019-7-3439e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-7-3439e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:37:00", "text": "Will do, Charlie! I'll update you once I have more insights from the Django PR. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261019-8-02a6e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-8-02a6e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:39:00", "text": "Same here, I'll keep you posted on both the OAuth2 Proxy and WordPress issues. Thanks for coordinating, Charlie!", "utterranceID": "20261019-9-9c9c0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-9-9c9c0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:29:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect sarcasm detection in our sentiment analysis engine has been resolved. You can check the details here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/40", "utterranceID": "20261021-0-bc593"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-0-bc593"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:32:00", "text": "That's great news, Ian! Can you remind us what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20261021-1-2822d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-1-2822d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:37:00", "text": "Sure, David. The root cause was that our sentiment model lacked advanced contextual understanding and tone detection, which are crucial for identifying sarcasm.", "utterranceID": "20261021-2-e7e4c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-2-e7e4c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:42:00", "text": "How did you manage to fix it, @eid_31cb6db5?", "utterranceID": "20261021-3-dee68"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-3-dee68"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:44:00", "text": "Good question, Charlie. We enhanced the model by integrating a new layer that uses transformer-based architecture to better understand context and tone. This allows it to differentiate between literal and sarcastic remarks more effectively.", "utterranceID": "20261021-4-70cf9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-4-70cf9"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-04-20T11:41:00", "text": "On the Slack integration front, we should update the Slack Integration section to include strategies for handling API rate limits and connectivity issues. Maybe add a subsection on error monitoring and recovery mechanisms to ensure real-time updates are consistent. 🔄", "utterranceID": "20260420-3-30fa9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260420-3-30fa9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_47d43bc4", "timestamp": "2026-04-20T11:44:00", "text": "For the UI issues, we need to emphasize user-centered design principles in the User Interface Dashboard section. Perhaps we can add a note about conducting regular UX testing and gathering user feedback to continuously improve the interface. 🖥️", "utterranceID": "20260420-4-7818c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260420-4-7818c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_96000199", "timestamp": "2026-04-20T11:47:07", "text": "@here Explore the TextBlob library, a simple yet powerful tool for processing textual data. It's a great resource for building sentiment analysis features like those in imentAIX. https://textblob.readthedocs.io/en/dev/", "utterranceID": "20260420-124-3cfe8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260420-124-3cfe8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5346d7a5", "timestamp": "2026-04-20T11:48:00", "text": "Yes, and let's also include a plan for onboarding resources or tutorials in the Customer Support section to help new users get up to speed quickly. 📖", "utterranceID": "20260420-5-b416a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260420-5-b416a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f48dbe55", "timestamp": "2026-04-20T11:53:00", "text": "Regarding performance with large teams, we should enhance the Scalability and Customization section to include performance testing and optimization strategies. This could involve stress testing and resource allocation improvements. 📈", "utterranceID": "20260420-6-6927c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260420-6-6927c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2470307f", "timestamp": "2026-04-20T11:58:00", "text": "And for customization, let's expand on the configuration dashboard capabilities in the Customization section. We should highlight the potential for modular architecture to support more flexible reporting templates. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20260420-7-9f504"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260420-7-9f504"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fd8cecea", "timestamp": "2026-04-20T12:00:00", "text": "Great suggestions, everyone! 🎉 To summarize, we'll update the NLP Engine for sarcasm detection, enhance Slack integration strategies, improve UI design and onboarding, optimize performance for large teams, and expand customization options. I'll draft these changes and share them for final review. Next steps: let's aim to finalize the document by the end of the week. Thanks, team! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260420-8-5e011"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260420-8-5e011"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fd8cecea", "timestamp": "2026-04-20T19:39:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_imentaix_product_requirements_document|Product Requirements Document>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260420-0-df31a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260420-0-df31a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5890ce38", "timestamp": "2026-04-23T02:56:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Technical Specifications Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We need to address the sentiment analysis misinterpretation, Slack integration inconsistencies, UI challenges, performance issues with large teams, and limited customization options. Let's dive in! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260422-0-577e1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260422-0-577e1"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T07:12:00", "text": "First up, there's a 'Weak Password Policy Enforcement' issue in WordPress. The system allows users to set weak passwords, which could lead to unauthorized access to admin panels. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/WordPress/WordPress/pull/155. @eid_8658e19c, this seems quite similar to what you're working on. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20260903-1-aa3d8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-1-aa3d8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T07:14:00", "text": "Thanks, Emma! This is definitely relevant. I'll review their approach to see if we can apply any of their solutions to our User Authentication Module. 🔐", "utterranceID": "20260903-2-bfc56"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-2-bfc56"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T07:15:00", "text": "Great! Next, we have an 'Inefficient Index Utilization' issue in PostgreSQL. Their queries aren't using available indexes effectively, leading to slow response times for large datasets. Here's the PR: https://github.com/postgres/postgres/pull/156. Bob, this sounds like what you're handling. Any insights?", "utterranceID": "20260903-3-e58a9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-3-e58a9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T07:19:00", "text": "Absolutely, Emma! I'll dive into their PR to see how they optimized index usage. It might give us some ideas to enhance our Database Management System. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260903-4-3b5d1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-4-3b5d1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T07:24:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks Bob! Lastly, there's a 'Session Hijacking Vulnerability' issue in Django. It involves a session management flaw that allows attackers to hijack user sessions. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/django/django/pull/157. Julia, this seems right up your alley. What do you think?", "utterranceID": "20260903-5-caf51"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-5-caf51"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T07:27:00", "text": "Thanks, Emma! I'll check out their fix for securing user sessions. It could be really helpful for our own session management improvements. 🔒", "utterranceID": "20260903-6-04409"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-6-04409"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T07:28:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's use these insights to make SentimentForce even better. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or have questions. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260903-7-8eec0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-7-8eec0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T07:30:00", "text": "Will do! Let's get these issues sorted. 💪", "utterranceID": "20260903-8-e3e2a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-8-e3e2a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T07:35:00", "text": "On it! Thanks for coordinating, Emma. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260903-9-e7d31"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-9-e7d31"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T07:40:00", "text": "Thanks, team! Let's make SentimentForce even better. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260903-10-36cc0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-10-36cc0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T17:51:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about 'Inefficient Index Utilization' in our database.", "utterranceID": "20260906-0-60af8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-0-60af8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T17:55:00", "text": "The concern was that the database fails to utilize existing indexes effectively, leading to full table scans during sentiment data queries.", "utterranceID": "20260906-1-34687"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-1-34687"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T17:59:00", "text": "After reviewing the database configuration and query execution plans, I've determined that this is not a bug that requires fixing.", "utterranceID": "20260906-2-83647"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-2-83647"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T18:02:00", "text": "Could you elaborate on why it's not a bug, Bob?", "utterranceID": "20260906-3-f8871"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-3-f8871"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92294e45", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:16:00", "text": "Hey Bob, could you explain why it's not a bug?", "utterranceID": "20260921-3-cf27f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-3-cf27f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:20:00", "text": "Sure, @eid_92294e45. The JSON parser is actually functioning as expected. The errors were due to malformed JSON responses that were not compliant with Slack's API documentation.", "utterranceID": "20260921-4-e84f1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-4-e84f1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:23:00", "text": "These malformed responses are rare and typically result from network issues or third-party integrations sending unexpected data.", "utterranceID": "20260921-5-012cb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-5-012cb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:26:00", "text": "So, it's more of a data integrity issue rather than a bug in our system?", "utterranceID": "20260921-6-bdb18"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-6-bdb18"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:27:00", "text": "Exactly, Emma. Our system is designed to handle well-formed JSON as per the API specs. Handling every possible malformed structure would be inefficient and unnecessary.", "utterranceID": "20260921-7-325fc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-7-325fc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92294e45", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:31:00", "text": "Thanks for clarifying, Bob. Did you take any action to verify this?", "utterranceID": "20260921-8-6f7e7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-8-6f7e7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:34:00", "text": "Yes, I reviewed the logs and tested with both valid and intentionally malformed JSON. The system processed valid JSON correctly and only failed on malformed data, which is expected.", "utterranceID": "20260921-9-3c2d0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-9-3c2d0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:37:00", "text": "Got it. Thanks for the thorough investigation, Bob.", "utterranceID": "20260921-10-949ce"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-10-949ce"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:41:00", "text": "No problem, happy to help! If any further issues arise, feel free to reach out.", "utterranceID": "20260921-11-8b26d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-11-8b26d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T16:45:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SentimentForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260930-0-740a7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-0-740a7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T16:46:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Incorrect Sentiment Analysis Due to Emoji Misinterpretation'. The sentiment analysis engine is misinterpreting certain emojis, like the 'smiling face with smiling eyes', as negative. This affects the Sentiment Analysis Engine and impacts leaders who rely on accurate sentiment reports. Customer ID: CUST-0089. @eid_4df5d4b7, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20260930-1-33b52"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-1-33b52"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T16:50:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the emoji interpretation logic and see what's causing the misinterpretation. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260930-2-c30f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-2-c30f5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T16:51:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have an 'Inefficient Query Execution Plan' issue. The database management system is generating suboptimal query execution plans, leading to slow response times for sentiment reports. This affects the Database Management System and impacts Customer ID: CUST-0072. @eid_fa6ec727, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20260930-3-28eab"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-3-28eab"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T16:54:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll optimize the query execution plans to improve performance. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260930-4-ceb34"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-4-ceb34"}

