{"Channel": {"name": "develop-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-d38149"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-07-15T01:27:00", "text": "Yeah, @David Miller, I noticed that too. The zoom reset isn't working as expected. @eid_fa6ec727, could you take a look at that? It might be a small fix. Everything else looks great though! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260716-3-acb4d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-3-acb4d"}
