{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_96000199", "timestamp": "2026-04-16T11:29:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Product Vision Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We've got some areas to address, especially around sarcasm detection, Slack integration, UI intuitiveness, performance with large teams, and customization options. Let's dive in! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260414-0-6eee5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260414-0-6eee5"}
