{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_96000199", "timestamp": "2026-04-16T11:38:00", "text": "@eid_d96fb219 @eid_2589c967 Great suggestions! Let's definitely include those. I'll make a note to add a section on enhancing training data and contextual analysis in the NLP Engine. Ian, your idea about user feedback is spot on. Let's add that to the UI Dashboard section. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260414-3-19547"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260414-3-19547"}
