{"Channel": {"name": "develop-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-6f5390"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-06-29T10:18:00", "text": "@eid_8658e19 joined develop-emmamiller-SentimentForce.", "utterranceID": "20260629-63-e5601"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260629-63-e5601"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-6f5390"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-06-29T12:07:00", "text": "Hi team, I wanted to kick off a discussion about our new PR for elastic scaling in multilingual processing. I found some interesting open-source projects that have implemented similar features. Let's see what we can learn from them! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260629-0-25c85"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260629-0-25c85"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-6f5390"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92294e45", "timestamp": "2026-06-29T12:12:00", "text": "Sounds great, Fiona! What do you have for us?", "utterranceID": "20260629-1-d9c53"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260629-1-d9c53"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-6f5390"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-06-29T12:16:00", "text": "First up, we have Apache Kafka's feature for Dynamic Topic Partition Scaling. It automatically scales topic partitions based on message throughput and consumer demand. Here's the link: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/2128. What do you think, @eid_8658e19?", "utterranceID": "20260629-2-156f1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260629-2-156f1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-6f5390"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19", "timestamp": "2026-06-29T12:19:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona! This is pretty relevant. Kafka's approach to scaling based on throughput could be useful for us, especially since we're dealing with varying loads of multilingual data. It might give us some ideas on how to handle dynamic resource allocation. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260629-3-36653"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260629-3-36653"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-6f5390"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-06-29T12:24:00", "text": "I agree with Ian. Kafka's method of monitoring throughput could help us optimize our resource usage. Plus, it's a proven model in the industry, so definitely worth considering!", "utterranceID": "20260629-4-8de70"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260629-4-8de70"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-SupportForce", "channelID": "ch-force-076b01"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f95e63d8", "timestamp": "2026-11-10T04:44:00", "text": "Next, there's a 'Concurrent Modification Exception'. The interface freezes when users modify error log entries while the AI is processing them. This also impacts the User Interface and affects customer CUST-0042. @eid_b9189afb, you're on this one too.", "utterranceID": "20261110-3-d1bb1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261110-3-d1bb1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-SupportForce", "channelID": "ch-force-076b01"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b9189afb", "timestamp": "2026-11-10T04:46:00", "text": "Understood, I'll handle the Concurrent Modification Exception as well. Let's get these UI issues sorted out! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261110-4-cce63"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261110-4-cce63"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-SupportForce", "channelID": "ch-force-076b01"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f95e63d8", "timestamp": "2026-11-10T04:48:00", "text": "Lastly, we have an 'Inefficient Query Execution Plan' issue. The AI generates suboptimal SQL queries, impacting Database Management and affecting customer CUST-0106. @eid_11732422, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261110-5-e76cf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261110-5-e76cf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-SupportForce", "channelID": "ch-force-076b01"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_11732422", "timestamp": "2026-11-10T04:51:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the Inefficient Query Execution Plan issue and see how we can optimize those queries. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261110-6-13930"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261110-6-13930"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-SupportForce", "channelID": "ch-force-076b01"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f95e63d8", "timestamp": "2026-11-10T04:55:00", "text": "Great, thanks everyone for jumping on these so quickly! If you need any more details or run into any roadblocks, just shout. Let's keep our customers happy! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261110-7-73217"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261110-7-73217"}
