{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-07-06T06:18:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with TrendForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260705-0-ceb90"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-0-ceb90"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-07-06T06:19:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Inadequate Handling of Missing Data'. The Trend Analysis Algorithm is providing inaccurate predictions when datasets have missing values. This could lead to misguided decisions for our users, especially in strategic planning. Impacted customer: CUST-0010. @eid_5782059f, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20260705-1-654fa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-1-654fa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-07-06T06:24:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the Trend Analysis Algorithm and see how we can improve the imputation method. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260705-2-396b8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-2-396b8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-07-06T06:25:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Data Refresh Latency in Real-Time Reports'. The Report Generation Module isn't updating reports promptly, which is causing users to see outdated information. This could undermine confidence in our tool. Impacted customer: CUST-0074. @eid_b4d260c1, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20260705-3-160fb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-3-160fb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b4d260c1", "timestamp": "2026-07-06T06:29:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll look into the report generation process and see what's causing the delay. Let's get those reports up to speed! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260705-4-8aab6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-4-8aab6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-07-06T06:31:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, we have 'Rate Limiting Misconfiguration'. The API Authentication Layer is throttling requests unexpectedly, which is disrupting external applications relying on TrendForce data. Impacted customer: CUST-0064. @eid_01942cf0, can you take a look at this?", "utterranceID": "20260705-5-d0466"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-5-d0466"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2026-07-06T06:35:00", "text": "On it! I'll check the API settings and see why the rate limiting is misconfigured. Let's ensure smooth data access for our external apps. 🔧", "utterranceID": "20260705-6-6d323"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-6-6d323"}
