{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_792330e0", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T23:29:00", "text": "Great feedback, everyone! Here's a summary of the key changes: simplify UI layout, enhance user testing, optimize server capacity, improve algorithms, expand API support, and strengthen system reliability. I'll compile these suggestions and draft the updated document. Let's reconvene next week to review the changes. Thanks, team! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260401-9-65fd2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260401-9-65fd2"}
