{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-09-14T07:27:00", "text": "This configuration is intentional to ensure that the data we present is accurate and reliable, even if it means a slight delay in real-time updates.", "utterranceID": "20260913-4-e0eea"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260913-4-e0eea"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0f6b0aea", "timestamp": "2026-09-14T07:28:00", "text": "Got it, Alice. So, it's more of a design choice rather than a technical issue?", "utterranceID": "20260913-5-59819"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260913-5-59819"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-09-14T07:30:00", "text": "Exactly, Bob. I verified the system logs and configuration settings to confirm that everything is functioning as intended.", "utterranceID": "20260913-6-e300d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260913-6-e300d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-09-14T07:35:00", "text": "Thanks for clarifying, Alice. Should we document this somewhere to avoid future confusion?", "utterranceID": "20260913-7-88e19"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260913-7-88e19"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-09-14T07:38:00", "text": "Good point, Ian. I'll update the project documentation to reflect this behavior as expected and not a bug.", "utterranceID": "20260913-8-b96e2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260913-8-b96e2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2026-09-14T07:39:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice. That should help clear things up for anyone else who encounters this.", "utterranceID": "20260913-9-9d41b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260913-9-9d41b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-09-14T07:44:00", "text": "No problem, team. Let me know if there's anything else you need!", "utterranceID": "20260913-10-7ab3f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260913-10-7ab3f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-09-20T08:46:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Visualization Rendering Lag' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/TrendForce/pull/35.", "utterranceID": "20260920-0-07895"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260920-0-07895"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-09-20T08:47:00", "text": "The root cause was that our rendering engine wasn't optimized for handling dynamic data updates. This led to excessive computation and rendering times, causing significant delays in the user interface.", "utterranceID": "20260920-1-26cae"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260920-1-26cae"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-09-20T08:49:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a more efficient data processing algorithm that reduces redundant computations. Additionally, I introduced a caching mechanism for static parts of the visualization, which significantly speeds up the rendering process when dynamic data updates occur.", "utterranceID": "20260920-2-2ad7d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260920-2-2ad7d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2026-09-20T08:52:00", "text": "Great work, George! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. I'll test it out and let you know if I encounter any issues.", "utterranceID": "20260920-3-29b26"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260920-3-29b26"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-09-20T08:56:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_5782059f! This should improve the user experience significantly. I'll update the documentation to reflect these changes.", "utterranceID": "20260920-4-7610d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260920-4-7610d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-09-20T09:00:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie and Ian. Let me know if there's anything else that needs attention or further improvement.", "utterranceID": "20260920-5-ff58d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260920-5-ff58d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T19:54:00", "text": "Hi team, the customer has reopened the 'Visualization Rendering Lag' bug. It seems the issue has resurfaced with the latest dynamic data updates. 😕", "utterranceID": "20260922-0-62318"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260922-0-62318"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T19:56:00", "text": "Oh no, that's unexpected! I thought we had it resolved. 😅 Do we have any new details on what's causing it this time?", "utterranceID": "20260922-1-5a1a6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260922-1-5a1a6"}

