{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_36319f22", "timestamp": "2026-03-31T12:16:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_daix_product_requirements_document|Product Requirements Document>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260331-0-2ce2c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260331-0-2ce2c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_792330e0", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T23:06:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Technical Specifications Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. 🚀 We need to address the user interface complexity, performance inconsistencies, trend identification accuracy, integration limitations, and system reliability. Let's dive in! @eid_82e9fcef @eid_fa16fefb @eid_798684b4 @eid_c7622c8e @eid_7c6dd6a6 @eid_435d10af @eid_36319f22 @eid_3f2087c9", "utterranceID": "20260401-0-3a034"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260401-0-3a034"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T23:06:06", "text": "@here Explore the TensorFlow library on GitHub, a must-have for deep learning applications in trend prediction and analysis. https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow", "utterranceID": "20260401-117-08af1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260401-117-08af1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T23:07:00", "text": "For the user interface, I suggest we simplify the layout by reducing the number of visible features on the main dashboard. We could implement a more guided onboarding process to help new users. Thoughts? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260401-1-d6d5a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260401-1-d6d5a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_798684b4", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T23:10:00", "text": "I agree with Ian. Also, we should incorporate more user-friendly design principles and conduct extensive user testing to ensure the interface meets user needs. Maybe add a section in the document about user testing protocols?", "utterranceID": "20260401-2-9420f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260401-2-9420f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f2087c9", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T23:13:00", "text": "Regarding performance, we should look into optimizing our server capacity and resource allocation. Perhaps we can add a section on performance monitoring strategies to the document? 📈", "utterranceID": "20260401-3-41a4a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260401-3-41a4a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T23:14:00", "text": "Good point, Ian. We should also review our code for inefficiencies and consider implementing more scalable algorithms. I'll draft some changes for the technical section.", "utterranceID": "20260401-4-d90a6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260401-4-d90a6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7c6dd6a6", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T23:17:00", "text": "For the trend identification issue, we might need to enhance our algorithms to detect subtle patterns better. Adding more customization options for users to adjust the sensitivity could be beneficial. Should we include this in the future development section?", "utterranceID": "20260401-5-81626"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260401-5-81626"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_435d10af", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T23:19:00", "text": "Yes, Fiona. We should also improve our data preprocessing and feature engineering processes. I'll work on a draft for that section.", "utterranceID": "20260401-6-26db3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260401-6-26db3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_36319f22", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T23:20:00", "text": "On the integration front, we need to update our API support and focus on interoperability. Let's add a section on expanding third-party integrations and partnerships.", "utterranceID": "20260401-7-c41c6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260401-7-c41c6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c7622c8e", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T23:24:00", "text": "For system reliability, we should enhance our infrastructure stability and implement better redundancy and failover mechanisms. I'll suggest some changes for the operational practices section.", "utterranceID": "20260401-8-966b4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260401-8-966b4"}

