{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-08-13T05:52:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect encryption of exported files has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/TrendForce/pull/27.", "utterranceID": "20260812-0-f3f10"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260812-0-f3f10"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2026-08-13T05:56:00", "text": "Great news, Alice! Could you explain what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20260812-1-caa9f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260812-1-caa9f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-08-13T05:58:00", "text": "Sure, Charlie. The root cause was that the encryption algorithm we were using was outdated and had vulnerabilities that were susceptible to known attacks. This compromised the confidentiality of the data during transmission.", "utterranceID": "20260812-2-d9451"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260812-2-d9451"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-08-13T06:03:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Alice. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20260812-3-f1844"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260812-3-f1844"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-08-13T06:05:00", "text": "I updated the encryption algorithm to AES-256, which is much more secure and widely used for protecting sensitive data. Additionally, I implemented a secure key exchange mechanism to further enhance security.", "utterranceID": "20260812-4-b64c0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260812-4-b64c0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b4d260c1", "timestamp": "2026-08-13T06:07:00", "text": "Nice work, @eid_92c62291! This should definitely improve our data security.", "utterranceID": "20260812-5-8c05b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260812-5-8c05b"}
