{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5b4b89"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4fc423da", "timestamp": "2026-05-14T01:42:00", "text": "Hi team, I was reading about SmartViz AI and thought it would be useful to discuss some of its weaknesses. They have limited support for on-premise data sources, which could be a significant drawback for clients with strict data security policies. Additionally, their AI-generated forecasts have been reported to be occasionally inaccurate, and their visualization options are quite basic, which might not meet all user needs.", "utterranceID": "20260518-0-5a8fc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260518-0-5a8fc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5b4b89"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3b36c220", "timestamp": "2026-05-14T01:46:00", "text": "@eid_4fc423da Thanks for the insights, Charlie. The limited support for on-premise data sources sounds like a big issue. Do you know if they have any plans to improve this?", "utterranceID": "20260518-1-5ab3d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260518-1-5ab3d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5b4b89"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4fc423da", "timestamp": "2026-05-14T01:51:00", "text": "From what I've gathered, they are aware of the limitation but haven't announced any concrete plans to address it yet. It seems like they're focusing more on cloud-based solutions at the moment.", "utterranceID": "20260518-2-11876"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260518-2-11876"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5b4b89"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0c373165", "timestamp": "2026-05-14T01:53:00", "text": "Interesting 🤔. The inaccuracies in AI forecasts could be a dealbreaker for data-driven companies. Do we know how often these inaccuracies occur?", "utterranceID": "20260518-3-031a4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260518-3-031a4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5b4b89"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4fc423da", "timestamp": "2026-05-14T01:55:00", "text": "Good question, George. The frequency of inaccuracies isn't well-documented, but user feedback suggests it's enough to cause concern for some businesses relying heavily on precise data.", "utterranceID": "20260518-4-1f53a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260518-4-1f53a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5b4b89"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0dd1bf2e", "timestamp": "2026-05-14T01:57:00", "text": "The basic visualization options are surprising. In today's market, users expect more advanced and customizable visualizations. Do they offer any customization at all?", "utterranceID": "20260518-5-a9840"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260518-5-a9840"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5b4b89"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4fc423da", "timestamp": "2026-05-14T02:01:00", "text": "They do offer some level of customization, but it's quite limited compared to what users might expect from a modern analytics tool. This could be a sticking point for users looking for more sophisticated data presentation.", "utterranceID": "20260518-6-eb922"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260518-6-eb922"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5b4b89"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9c876927", "timestamp": "2026-05-14T02:05:00", "text": "🤔 It sounds like they might be targeting a different segment of the market. Maybe those who don't need complex visualizations or on-premise support?", "utterranceID": "20260518-7-da47b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260518-7-da47b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5b4b89"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3b36c220", "timestamp": "2026-05-14T02:06:00", "text": "That's a good point, Hannah. They might be focusing on smaller businesses or those just starting with AI analytics. But still, the inaccuracies could be a major issue regardless of the market segment.", "utterranceID": "20260518-8-7e4e7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260518-8-7e4e7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5b4b89"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0c373165", "timestamp": "2026-05-14T02:11:00", "text": "Agreed. It might be worth keeping an eye on how they evolve. If they address these weaknesses, they could become more competitive.", "utterranceID": "20260518-9-9fc5b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260518-9-9fc5b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5b4b89"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4fc423da", "timestamp": "2026-05-14T02:16:00", "text": "Absolutely. It's always good to stay informed about what the competition is doing. Let's keep monitoring their updates and see how they progress.", "utterranceID": "20260518-10-b714f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260518-10-b714f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5b4b89"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0dd1bf2e", "timestamp": "2026-05-14T02:20:00", "text": "Thanks for the info, Charlie! This was really helpful. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260518-11-00535"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260518-11-00535"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8d4cc8"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T03:17:00", "text": "@eid_131494b8 created this channel on 2026-11-12 03:17:00. This is the very beginning of the bug-fionadavis-VizForce channel.", "utterranceID": "20261112-0-8014f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-0-8014f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8d4cc8"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T03:17:00", "text": "@eid_131494b8 joined bug-fionadavis-VizForce. Also, @eid_2594f98a, @eid_70223d0a, @eid_69130545, @eid_8986ddc3, @eid_63ea0ec4 joined via invite.", "utterranceID": "20261112-1-87d66"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-1-87d66"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8d4cc8"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:22:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with VizForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261112-0-e81f9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-0-e81f9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8d4cc8"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:25:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Incorrect Trend Analysis in Time-Series Data'. The AI Model & Data Processing Engine is generating visualizations that misrepresent trends, which could lead to incorrect business decisions. This is impacting customer CUST-0024. @eid_63ea0ec4, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261112-1-f3f6e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-1-f3f6e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8d4cc8"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_63ea0ec4", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:26:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the AI Model & Data Processing Engine to see what's causing the misrepresentation. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261112-2-90aec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-2-90aec"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8d4cc8"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:30:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Memory Leak in Visualization Rendering'. This is affecting the User Interface & Rendering Layer, causing performance issues and crashes, especially during critical tasks. Customer CUST-0110 is impacted. @eid_8986ddc3, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20261112-3-5f45b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-3-5f45b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8d4cc8"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8986ddc3", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:31:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll start looking into the rendering layer to identify the memory leak. We need to ensure smooth performance for our users. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261112-4-a8e4e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-4-a8e4e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8d4cc8"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:36:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_8986ddc3! Lastly, there's a 'Missing Data Field in API Payload'. This is causing issues in the API & Data Integration Layer, leading to incomplete visualizations. It's affecting customer CUST-0067. @eid_70223d0a, can you take a look?", "utterranceID": "20261112-5-daeea"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-5-daeea"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8d4cc8"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_70223d0a", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:38:00", "text": "On it! I'll review the API responses and ensure all necessary data fields are included. Let's get this sorted for our developers. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20261112-6-d7e30"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-6-d7e30"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8d4cc8"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:40:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks everyone for jumping on these so quickly! Let me know if you need any more details or support. Let's keep our customers happy! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261112-7-97afc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-7-97afc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8d4cc8"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_63ea0ec4", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:43:00", "text": "Will do! I'll update once I have more info. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261112-8-263a8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-8-263a8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8d4cc8"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8986ddc3", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:48:00", "text": "Same here, I'll keep you posted on the progress. Thanks for coordinating, @eid_131494b8!", "utterranceID": "20261112-9-5e7a9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-9-5e7a9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8d4cc8"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_70223d0a", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:52:00", "text": "Thanks, I'll reach out if I hit any roadblocks. Let's get these issues resolved! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261112-10-163e8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-10-163e8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8d4cc8"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T05:25:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that are similar to the ones we're tackling in Salesforce. Let's take a look and see if we can learn anything from them! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261114-0-fc654"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-0-fc654"}

{"Channel": {"name": "develop-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c70b38"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-15T06:00:00", "text": "I agree with Fiona, the implementation looks clean. However, I noticed that the integration tests for Zoom are missing. 😅 We need those to ensure everything works as expected.", "utterranceID": "20261217-4-23c89"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-4-23c89"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c70b38"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-15T06:03:00", "text": "Ah, good catch, Julia! I got caught up in the implementation and forgot to add the tests. I'll work on writing those integration tests right away. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20261217-5-91e03"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-5-91e03"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c70b38"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-12-15T06:07:00", "text": "No worries, @eid_d96fb219! Also, I noticed the user documentation hasn't been updated with the Zoom setup and usage instructions. Could you add that as well? 📚", "utterranceID": "20261217-6-5afcd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-6-5afcd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c70b38"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-15T06:11:00", "text": "Absolutely, Fiona. I'll update the documentation to include the Zoom setup and usage instructions. Thanks for pointing that out! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261217-7-e7264"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-7-e7264"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c70b38"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-15T06:15:00", "text": "Sounds good, @eid_d96fb219. Once those changes are in, I'll be happy to take another look. Let us know when it's ready! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261217-8-5cf85"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-8-5cf85"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c70b38"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-15T06:18:00", "text": "Will do, Julia! Thanks for the feedback, everyone. I'll ping you once I've made the updates. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261217-9-a5eb2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-9-a5eb2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c70b38"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-12-16T16:15:00", "text": "@here try out our product with this live demo https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/SummarizeForce/demo_3", "utterranceID": "20261216-0-ba3df"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261216-0-ba3df"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c70b38"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92294e45", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T23:22:00", "text": "Hi team, 👋 I was looking into some open-source projects to see how they handle integrations similar to our proposed Zoom feature. Thought it might be helpful to discuss and see if we can draw any inspiration. Let's dive in! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261227-0-b74a9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261227-0-b74a9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c70b38"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T23:27:00", "text": "Sounds great, Hannah! What did you find? 😊", "utterranceID": "20261227-1-0274b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261227-1-0274b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c70b38"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92294e45", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T23:31:00", "text": "First up, we have Mattermost's Microsoft Teams Integration. They added support for Teams by implementing platform-specific logic to summarize chat conversations. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-server/pull/3403. What do you all think? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20261227-2-3da76"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261227-2-3da76"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c70b38"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T23:35:00", "text": "@eid_92294e45 That's interesting! It seems quite similar to what we're aiming for with Zoom. I like how they focus on summarizing conversations. We could definitely consider a similar approach for our abstract API layer. 📊", "utterranceID": "20261227-3-5c5c2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261227-3-5c5c2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c70b38"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T23:38:00", "text": "Agreed, Julia. The summarization aspect is key. I wonder if they faced any challenges with the API rate limits or data privacy concerns. 🤔", "utterranceID": "20261227-4-d601a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261227-4-d601a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c70b38"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92294e45", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T23:40:00", "text": "Good point, Emma. I'll look into their discussions and see if there are any insights on those challenges. Next, we have Rocket.Chat's Google Meet Integration. It allows users to initiate and manage meetings directly from channels. Check it out here: https://github.com/RocketChat/Rocket.Chat/pull/3404.", "utterranceID": "20261227-5-63082"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261227-5-63082"}

