{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8c71a7a9", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T08:57:00", "text": "What about the design? Is the parameter adjustment process too complex to explain easily?", "utterranceID": "20260705-7-1aa09"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-7-1aa09"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T08:58:00", "text": "That's possible. We might need to simplify the process or at least make the explanation clearer.", "utterranceID": "20260705-8-f96b0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-8-f96b0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_35e32fec", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T09:01:00", "text": "Agreed. We should look into all these aspects and see where improvements can be made.", "utterranceID": "20260705-9-0a24a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-9-0a24a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2490c02c", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T09:02:00", "text": "Let's make sure these issues are documented in the planning documents for the next release of ATF_AIX.", "utterranceID": "20260705-10-9ff94"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-10-9ff94"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T09:06:00", "text": "Absolutely. I'll start drafting some notes on this.", "utterranceID": "20260705-11-99d08"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-11-99d08"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ad0725a2", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T09:07:00", "text": "Great. Thanks, everyone, for the input. Let's keep this momentum going.", "utterranceID": "20260705-12-1d006"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-12-1d006"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2490c02c", "timestamp": "2026-06-18T17:06:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers have reported positive things about ATF_AIX. It's great to see such feedback!", "utterranceID": "20260903-0-60416"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-0-60416"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-06-18T17:09:00", "text": "That's awesome! What did they say, Bob?", "utterranceID": "20260903-1-148ed"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-1-148ed"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2490c02c", "timestamp": "2026-06-18T17:14:00", "text": "Customer CUST-0093 praised the platform for its robust performance on high-end systems, especially with large datasets. No significant lag reported!", "utterranceID": "20260903-2-17541"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-2-17541"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-06-18T17:17:00", "text": "Impressive! Handling large datasets efficiently is a big win. Kudos to the previous team!", "utterranceID": "20260903-3-f4299"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-3-f4299"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_35e32fec", "timestamp": "2026-06-18T17:18:00", "text": "@eid_2490c02c Any other feedback?", "utterranceID": "20260903-4-ec1eb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-4-ec1eb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2490c02c", "timestamp": "2026-06-18T17:19:00", "text": "Yes, Ian. Customer CUST-0029 mentioned that the Einstein Auto-Tuning feature offers comprehensive analytics and insights. It helps users understand the impact of parameter changes on model performance.", "utterranceID": "20260903-5-85799"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-5-85799"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ad0725a2", "timestamp": "2026-06-18T17:21:00", "text": "That's a great feature to highlight. Understanding parameter impacts is crucial for our users.", "utterranceID": "20260903-6-9ac85"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-6-9ac85"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8c71a7a9", "timestamp": "2026-06-18T17:23:00", "text": "Agreed, David. It's nice to see the product being appreciated. We should keep these strengths in mind for future updates.", "utterranceID": "20260903-7-74bcb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-7-74bcb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-06-18T17:25:00", "text": "Definitely. Let's make sure we maintain these strengths while adding our own improvements.", "utterranceID": "20260903-8-dee1f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-8-dee1f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-06-18T17:28:00", "text": "Sounds like a plan. Let's keep the momentum going!", "utterranceID": "20260903-9-282bc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-9-282bc"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-06-28T08:50:00", "text": "Sure, @eid_e42b000f. The auto-tuning process is resource-intensive, especially on less powerful systems. I suggest we add a section in the document about optimizing the algorithms for low-power systems and improving resource management. This could involve simplifying some of the computational processes or offering a 'light' mode for less powerful hardware. Thoughts, @eid_6f719d21?", "utterranceID": "20260628-1-1fdbf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260628-1-1fdbf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-06-28T08:53:00", "text": "I agree, David. We should also update the system requirements documentation to help users assess compatibility better. This could prevent performance issues before they arise. @eid_061285c7, do you think this would help with QA testing?", "utterranceID": "20260628-2-2c277"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260628-2-2c277"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_061285c7", "timestamp": "2026-06-28T08:55:00", "text": "Absolutely, Ian. Clearer system requirements would streamline our testing process and ensure we're covering all bases. We should also consider adding more detailed documentation for the parameter adjustment process. @eid_2490c02c, any thoughts on making the documentation more user-friendly?", "utterranceID": "20260628-3-6a94f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260628-3-6a94f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2490c02c", "timestamp": "2026-06-28T09:00:00", "text": "Good point, Julia. We could include step-by-step guides and video tutorials to make the parameter adjustment process clearer. This would help users understand the system better and reduce the learning curve. @eid_8c71a7a9, how do you feel about the integration issues?", "utterranceID": "20260628-4-7264b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260628-4-7264b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8c71a7a9", "timestamp": "2026-06-28T09:04:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob. For integration, we should expand the document to include support for more data formats and protocols. This would enhance compatibility with third-party data sources. We might also need to establish more partnerships with data providers. @eid_9c46088d, any input on reliability issues?", "utterranceID": "20260628-5-4744e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260628-5-4744e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9c46088d", "timestamp": "2026-06-28T09:09:00", "text": "Yes, Hannah. We need to improve our error handling and failover mechanisms to handle high data loads better. Adding a section on robust testing under high-load scenarios in the document would be beneficial. @eid_0719bc3e, do you think this aligns with our current testing strategies?", "utterranceID": "20260628-6-1e60e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260628-6-1e60e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0719bc3e", "timestamp": "2026-06-28T09:12:00", "text": "It does, Charlie. We should also consider adding more real-time monitoring tools to detect and address issues quickly. This could be included in the analytics dashboard section. @eid_7f22371d, any thoughts on the UI challenges?", "utterranceID": "20260628-7-ec5ec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260628-7-ec5ec"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7f22371d", "timestamp": "2026-06-28T09:16:00", "text": "For the UI, we need to simplify the interface and improve navigation. Adding user-friendly guidance features and onboarding resources in the document would help new users get up to speed faster. @eid_35e32fec, do you think this covers the design aspects?", "utterranceID": "20260628-8-5b74b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260628-8-5b74b"}

