{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EinsteinAuto-Tuning", "channelID": "ch-uning-f6ee06"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7017b913", "timestamp": "2026-06-23T19:31:00", "text": "Sounds good, George! I think we should start by clearly defining the problem we're solving. @eid_6c9bbe3a, any insights from your research?", "utterranceID": "20260623-1-a224c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260623-1-a224c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EinsteinAuto-Tuning", "channelID": "ch-uning-f6ee06"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6c9bbe3a", "timestamp": "2026-06-23T19:35:00", "text": "Absolutely! From our user interviews, the main challenge is the manual tuning of AI models. Users want a more automated solution that adapts in real-time. 📈", "utterranceID": "20260623-2-3c55d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260623-2-3c55d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EinsteinAuto-Tuning", "channelID": "ch-uning-f6ee06"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fce6544f", "timestamp": "2026-06-23T19:40:00", "text": "Great point, Julia. Let's ensure we highlight the real-time optimization feature prominently. It's a key differentiator. @eid_5318af37, maybe we can start with a draft outline?", "utterranceID": "20260623-3-44be3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260623-3-44be3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EinsteinAuto-Tuning", "channelID": "ch-uning-f6ee06"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5318af37", "timestamp": "2026-06-23T19:45:00", "text": "Sure thing, Charlie. Here's what I'm thinking for the outline: Introduction, Problem Statement, Solution Overview, Key Features, and Benefits. Thoughts? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260623-4-ddf7b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260623-4-ddf7b"}
