{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-66a156"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_04a698e5", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T17:45:00", "text": "Hi team, I wanted to kick off a discussion about our new feature for real-time data updates in the dashboard. I've found some similar features in open-source projects that might give us some insights. Let's dive in! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260919-0-70c7b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260919-0-70c7b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-66a156"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_36569bb7", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T17:50:00", "text": "Sounds great, George! What do you have for us? 😊", "utterranceID": "20260919-1-a6be6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260919-1-a6be6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-66a156"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_04a698e5", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T17:51:00", "text": "First up, we have Grafana's 'Live Data Streaming in Panels'. This feature integrates live data streaming into their panels, providing users with up-to-the-minute visualizations. You can check it out here: https://github.com/grafana/grafana/pull/3028", "utterranceID": "20260919-2-cbcc0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260919-2-cbcc0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-66a156"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6a0f49ba", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T17:56:00", "text": "That's pretty cool! Grafana's approach to live streaming could be really useful for us. It seems like they focus a lot on visualization, which is something we should consider. @eid_04a698e5, do you think we can adapt some of their techniques?", "utterranceID": "20260919-3-859fd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260919-3-859fd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-66a156"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_04a698e5", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T17:57:00", "text": "Definitely, George. I think their focus on visualization is key. I'll look into how they handle data streaming and see if we can incorporate similar strategies. 📊", "utterranceID": "20260919-4-b2116"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260919-4-b2116"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-66a156"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_961f0487", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T17:59:00", "text": "Next, we have Apache Superset's 'Auto-Refresh Dashboards'. This feature ensures dashboards are always current without user intervention. Here's the link: https://github.com/apache/superset/pull/3029", "utterranceID": "20260919-5-5cc9a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260919-5-5cc9a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-66a156"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_36569bb7", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T18:01:00", "text": "Auto-refresh is a classic! It's simple but effective. I think it aligns well with our goal of minimizing user effort. Maybe we can combine this with some of the real-time elements from Grafana?", "utterranceID": "20260919-6-143f4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260919-6-143f4"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_35e32fec", "timestamp": "2026-06-28T09:19:00", "text": "Yes, Fiona. Simplifying the UI and adding intuitive navigation will definitely help. We should also consider user feedback to continuously improve the design. @eid_e42b000f, do you think these changes cover the key issues?", "utterranceID": "20260628-9-6db2b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260628-9-6db2b"}
