{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-e89893"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_887367ca", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T23:45:00", "text": "Great point, Ian Smith. We can definitely add more details about the AI algorithms. I'll work with the engineering team to specify which algorithms will be used for personalization and task prioritization. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260711-2-f925a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260711-2-f925a"}
