{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-e89893"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c7622c8e", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T05:28:00", "text": "From a QA perspective, I'm curious about their testing strategy. They mention automated testing but not much detail. Could be a potential weakness. 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260728-5-ea369"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260728-5-ea369"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-e89893"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_36319f22", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T05:30:00", "text": "@Ian Miller, that's a good catch. We should ensure our testing strategy is well-documented and robust. Also, their UI seems very intuitive. We might want to take some inspiration there. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260728-6-9d0e3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260728-6-9d0e3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-e89893"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b4d260c1", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T05:32:00", "text": "Agreed, @Julia Davis. Their UI is sleek. But I noticed they don't mention much about user customization. Could be an area where we can differentiate ourselves. 💡", "utterranceID": "20260728-7-cf750"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260728-7-cf750"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-e89893"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9b8bc088", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T05:36:00", "text": "Great insights, everyone! Let's compile these observations and see how we can incorporate some of these ideas into our product strategy. Thanks for the input! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260728-8-e7eaf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260728-8-e7eaf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-e89893"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T05:41:00", "text": "Sounds good, @David Taylor. I'll start drafting a summary of our discussion. 📋", "utterranceID": "20260728-9-de691"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260728-9-de691"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-e89893"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T05:44:00", "text": "Thanks, @George Jones! Looking forward to seeing the summary. Let's keep pushing forward! 💪", "utterranceID": "20260728-10-9df6f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260728-10-9df6f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-e89893"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-08-07T05:02:00", "text": "@eid_fa16fefb, @eid_792330e0 joined planning-CForceAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260807-98-e4c9c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260807-98-e4c9c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-e89893"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2026-08-07T07:53:00", "text": "Hi team, I've shared the <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/cforceaix_system_design_document|System Design Document> for CForceAIX. Let's discuss any feedback or suggestions you might have. Looking forward to your thoughts! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260807-0-edc0e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260807-0-edc0e"}

{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T15:26:00", "text": "Hi all, I wasn't aware of these specific issues. The tests we ran didn't catch them. I'll look into it right away.", "utterranceID": "20260908-5-f49a3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-5-f49a3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9c876927", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T15:31:00", "text": "Given the impact, I think we should consider reverting the PR until these bugs are fixed. We can't afford to have our API unreliable.", "utterranceID": "20260908-6-7f37e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-6-7f37e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f3ea10f", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T15:36:00", "text": "Agreed. It's better to revert now and address the issues thoroughly before re-merging.", "utterranceID": "20260908-7-449e1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-7-449e1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T15:39:00", "text": "Understood. I'll prepare to revert the PR. I'll ensure the issues are fixed before we attempt another merge.", "utterranceID": "20260908-8-6df45"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-8-6df45"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_73a50f06", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T15:44:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_76d9cb07. Let us know if you need any help with testing once the fixes are in place.", "utterranceID": "20260908-9-fef94"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-9-fef94"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T15:49:00", "text": "Will do. I'll keep everyone updated on the progress. Thanks for catching this early, team.", "utterranceID": "20260908-10-22a71"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-10-22a71"}
