{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianjones-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-75e6bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-05-08T14:59:00", "text": "Good idea, George. Also, @eid_9f4e2c6f, I noticed the security tests are passing, but we should add a test to ensure no older TLS versions are accepted. Just to be thorough. 🛡️", "utterranceID": "20260508-7-70037"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260508-7-70037"}
