{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmiller-SecurityForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6a73a1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-06-06T13:14:00", "text": "@eid_968bc0a2 joined develop-hannahmiller-SecurityForce.", "utterranceID": "20260606-3-cda56"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260606-3-cda56"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmiller-SecurityForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6a73a1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_968bc0a2", "timestamp": "2026-06-06T15:26:00", "text": "Hi team, I was going through some open-source projects to find inspiration for our new REST API endpoints for Threat Intelligence Integration. I found a few interesting PRs that might be worth discussing. Let's dive in! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260606-0-87abb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260606-0-87abb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmiller-SecurityForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6a73a1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f50066b1", "timestamp": "2026-06-06T15:31:00", "text": "Sounds great, Charlie! What did you find?", "utterranceID": "20260606-1-4996f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260606-1-4996f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmiller-SecurityForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6a73a1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_968bc0a2", "timestamp": "2026-06-06T15:35:00", "text": "First up, we have a PR from Apache Kafka: [Add REST API Endpoints for Stream Monitoring](https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/2176). This PR implements endpoints for real-time monitoring and management of Kafka streams. It could be useful for us to see how they handle real-time data and monitoring.", "utterranceID": "20260606-2-481f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260606-2-481f5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmiller-SecurityForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6a73a1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0e5bec0e", "timestamp": "2026-06-06T15:37:00", "text": "Interesting! Real-time monitoring is definitely something we should consider. It might help us with threat detection and response times. @eid_f50066b1, what do you think?", "utterranceID": "20260606-3-a18e3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260606-3-a18e3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmiller-SecurityForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6a73a1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f50066b1", "timestamp": "2026-06-06T15:42:00", "text": "I agree, Fiona. Real-time capabilities could enhance our threat intelligence features significantly. We should look into how they structured their endpoints and see if we can adapt some of their ideas.", "utterranceID": "20260606-4-872f1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260606-4-872f1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmiller-SecurityForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6a73a1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_968bc0a2", "timestamp": "2026-06-06T15:47:00", "text": "Next, there's a PR from ElasticSearch: [Enhance REST API for Advanced Query Analytics](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/2177). This one introduces endpoints for complex query analytics and data visualization. It might give us some insights into handling complex data queries.", "utterranceID": "20260606-5-d31f2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260606-5-d31f2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmiller-SecurityForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6a73a1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0e5bec0e", "timestamp": "2026-06-06T15:49:00", "text": "Advanced query analytics could be a game-changer for us. It would allow users to perform more detailed threat analysis. We should definitely consider this approach.", "utterranceID": "20260606-6-5abf7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260606-6-5abf7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmiller-SecurityForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6a73a1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f50066b1", "timestamp": "2026-06-06T15:51:00", "text": "Absolutely, Fiona. Plus, ElasticSearch is known for its powerful search capabilities. We could learn a lot from their implementation.", "utterranceID": "20260606-7-e7fee"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260606-7-e7fee"}

{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-310592"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_524f697b", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T06:12:00", "text": "Great work on getting this done, @eid_5a557faa! I'll review it shortly. Excited to see how the widgets look! 📊", "utterranceID": "20260829-2-6d3ab"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-2-6d3ab"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-310592"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8b95a6f0", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T06:15:00", "text": "Hey @eid_5a557faa, I went through the PR. The widgets are looking good and I love the variety of data visualizations available. However, I noticed that the customization options aren't as intuitive as they could be. It took me a while to figure out how to adjust the widget sizes. 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260829-3-c871a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-3-c871a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-310592"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5a557faa", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T06:17:00", "text": "Thanks for the feedback, Alice! I can definitely work on making the customization options more user-friendly. Any specific suggestions on what could be improved?", "utterranceID": "20260829-4-3d99f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-4-3d99f"}
