{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgemiller-KnowledgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-310592"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cdd331bc", "timestamp": "2026-09-01T10:08:00", "text": "Hi team, I hope you're all doing well! 😊 I wanted to kick off a discussion about our new feature proposal for customizable widgets on our dashboard. I've found some interesting open-source projects that have implemented similar features. Let's dive in and see what we can learn from them!", "utterranceID": "20260901-0-e20aa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260901-0-e20aa"}
