{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianmiller-SearchFlow", "channelID": "ch-hflow-a687ca"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2543da6a", "timestamp": "2026-04-25T10:04:00", "text": "Hi team, please check my PR for the new feature: Implement GPT-Based Models for Improved Search Relevance. Here's the link: https://github.com/salesforce/SearchFlow/pull/5. This PR integrates GPT models into SearchFlow to enhance search result relevance. Let me know your thoughts! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260426-0-df148"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260426-0-df148"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_efc9418c", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T11:39:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone. Once we've reviewed these, let's regroup to discuss any potential improvements or issues we might foresee.", "utterranceID": "20260902-6-4c843"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260902-6-4c843"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T11:41:00", "text": "Sounds good. I'll also keep an eye on any feedback or issues reported by customers and QA specialists. Let's make sure we're addressing those as we move forward.", "utterranceID": "20260902-7-bfd33"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260902-7-bfd33"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T16:52:00", "text": "@here here’s a quick video showcasing the updates in our last release https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/chProX/demo_4", "utterranceID": "20261008-0-0be88"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-0-0be88"}
