{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-10-31T04:51:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_d098d618! Lastly, we have 'Unresponsive UI Elements During Data Drill-Down'. Users can't interact with specific data points for detailed analysis, which is frustrating for them. This is also in the User Interface & Data Visualization Module, impacting customer CUST-0102. @eid_b6268ef7, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261030-5-4b9ae"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-5-4b9ae"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6268ef7", "timestamp": "2026-10-31T04:52:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the drill-down issue and see what's causing the UI elements to become unresponsive. Let's get this sorted for CUST-0102! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261030-6-d6299"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-6-d6299"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-10-31T04:57:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks everyone for jumping on these issues so quickly. Let's keep the customers happy! If you need any more info or help, just shout. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261030-7-24ec0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-7-24ec0"}
