{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6268ef7", "timestamp": "2026-10-31T05:03:00", "text": "Thanks, I'll keep you posted on my progress. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261030-9-e3a7f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-9-e3a7f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T20:23:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might help us with our current Salesforce issues. Let's take a look at them! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261101-0-02617"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261101-0-02617"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T20:26:00", "text": "First up, we have a bug in Kibana titled 'Increased Latency in Dashboard Queries'. It seems their new query optimization feature is causing increased response times, similar to our latency issue. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/elastic/kibana/pull/1533. @Ian Miller, could you check this out and see if there are any insights we can apply to our situation?", "utterranceID": "20261101-1-cf142"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261101-1-cf142"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T20:31:00", "text": "Sure, Alice! I'll review the Kibana PR and see if their approach to handling increased latency can help us with our FlowForce issue. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261101-2-fac2d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261101-2-fac2d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T20:36:00", "text": "Great, thanks Ian! Next, there's a Grafana issue titled 'UI Freezes with Large Data Sets'. This sounds a lot like our UI freeze problem. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/grafana/grafana/pull/1534. Ian, since you're already looking into our UI issue, could you also take a look at this one?", "utterranceID": "20261101-3-d0e36"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261101-3-d0e36"}
