{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicesmith-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c3f2ea"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2027-04-18T07:56:00", "text": "@eid_439a052b created this channel on 2027-04-18 07:56:00. This is the very beginning of the bug-alicesmith-SearchForce channel.", "utterranceID": "20270418-0-94421"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270418-0-94421"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicesmith-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c3f2ea"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2027-04-18T07:56:00", "text": "@eid_439a052b joined bug-alicesmith-SearchForce. Also, @eid_7bd14403, @eid_0aa7db32, @eid_070b6e41, @eid_b7f0726e, @eid_51f0b41f, @eid_e7622cfb joined via invite.", "utterranceID": "20270418-1-00690"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270418-1-00690"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicesmith-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c3f2ea"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_439a052b", "timestamp": "2027-04-18T17:42:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SearchForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270418-0-721a1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270418-0-721a1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicesmith-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c3f2ea"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_439a052b", "timestamp": "2027-04-18T17:43:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Temporal Context Misalignment'. The problem is that SearchForce isn't accurately interpreting temporal references in queries, which affects the NLP Engine. This is causing users to receive search results that don't match their intended query context, leading to frustration. Impacted customer is CUST-0096. @eid_070b6e41, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20270418-1-dca15"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270418-1-dca15"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicesmith-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c3f2ea"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_070b6e41", "timestamp": "2027-04-18T17:48:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the NLP Engine and see what's causing the misalignment. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270418-2-7ed84"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270418-2-7ed84"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicesmith-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c3f2ea"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_439a052b", "timestamp": "2027-04-18T17:52:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'JavaScript Event Handling Errors'. This issue is affecting the User Interface (UI), where interactive elements like filters and sorting options aren't responding correctly to touch events on mobile devices. This is impacting the experience for mobile users, especially customer CUST-0038. @eid_7bd14403, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270418-3-53e04"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270418-3-53e04"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicesmith-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c3f2ea"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7bd14403", "timestamp": "2027-04-18T17:55:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll check out the UI and see why the touch events are acting up. Let's get those mobile users a better experience! 📱", "utterranceID": "20270418-4-f5870"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270418-4-f5870"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicesmith-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c3f2ea"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_439a052b", "timestamp": "2027-04-18T17:58:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, we have a serious issue titled 'Cross-Site Scripting in Query Results'. This affects the Security & Query Handling Module and could allow malicious users to execute unauthorized database operations. It's a potential security risk for customer CUST-0044. @eid_0aa7db32, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20270418-5-c9efb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270418-5-c9efb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicesmith-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c3f2ea"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0aa7db32", "timestamp": "2027-04-18T18:00:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll prioritize this and ensure we patch up the security flaw ASAP. Security is key! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20270418-6-7f4af"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270418-6-7f4af"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicesmith-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c3f2ea"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_439a052b", "timestamp": "2027-04-18T18:01:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep communication open as you work through these issues. Feel free to ask questions or share updates here. Let's make sure our customers have the best experience possible! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270418-7-348ee"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270418-7-348ee"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicesmith-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c3f2ea"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_070b6e41", "timestamp": "2027-04-18T18:06:00", "text": "Will do! I'll update once I have more info on the temporal context issue. 🕒", "utterranceID": "20270418-8-c18b5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270418-8-c18b5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicesmith-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c3f2ea"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7bd14403", "timestamp": "2027-04-18T18:07:00", "text": "Same here, I'll keep you posted on the UI fixes. Thanks for coordinating, @eid_439a052b! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270418-9-2908a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270418-9-2908a"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d79648"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c702b642", "timestamp": "2026-10-12T05:33:00", "text": "Sure, David. The root cause was an error in the data parsing logic within the VizForce AI module. It was failing to correctly convert data types during the extraction process from the database, which led to numeric data being misinterpreted as strings.", "utterranceID": "20261012-2-d1ec3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261012-2-d1ec3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d79648"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_57e922c4", "timestamp": "2026-10-12T05:38:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Alice. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261012-3-0d7fb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261012-3-0d7fb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d79648"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c702b642", "timestamp": "2026-10-12T05:39:00", "text": "I updated the data parsing logic to include a more robust type-checking mechanism. Now, it correctly identifies and converts numeric data types during extraction, ensuring that visualizations render accurately.", "utterranceID": "20261012-4-346a3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261012-4-346a3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d79648"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7702c98", "timestamp": "2026-10-12T05:41:00", "text": "Awesome work, Alice Jones! This should really improve the accuracy of our visualizations.", "utterranceID": "20261012-5-bcf2b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261012-5-bcf2b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d79648"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c702b642", "timestamp": "2026-10-12T05:42:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob! If anyone encounters any more issues, please let me know.", "utterranceID": "20261012-6-46073"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261012-6-46073"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d79648"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-10-12T05:47:00", "text": "Will do, @eid_c702b642. Thanks for the quick turnaround on this!", "utterranceID": "20261012-7-ff67b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261012-7-ff67b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d79648"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T13:33:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with VizForce that need our immediate attention. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261016-0-50b97"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261016-0-50b97"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d79648"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T13:36:00", "text": "First up, we have a security issue titled 'Session Hijacking via Insecure Cookies'. The session cookies aren't marked as secure or HttpOnly, which could lead to unauthorized access to user accounts and data. This affects the Security & Authentication Module and impacts customer CUST-0110. @eid_9685a278, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261016-1-03d00"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261016-1-03d00"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d79648"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9685a278", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T13:41:00", "text": "Got it! I'll prioritize this and start working on securing those cookies right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20261016-2-5f91d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261016-2-5f91d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d79648"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T13:46:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have an issue with 'Misclassification of Data Categories'. VizForce is misclassifying data, which leads to incorrect visualizations and could cause users to make poor business decisions. This affects the AI Model & Data Processing Engine and impacts customer CUST-0071. @eid_cc27a0cd, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20261016-3-6f09c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261016-3-6f09c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d79648"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cc27a0cd", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T13:48:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the AI model and see what's causing the misclassification. We need to ensure our users trust the insights VizForce provides. 🤖", "utterranceID": "20261016-4-f63f7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261016-4-f63f7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d79648"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T13:53:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_cc27a0cd! Lastly, there's an issue with 'Faulty Correlation Analysis'. The AI model is identifying false correlations, which again could mislead users. This also affects the AI Model & Data Processing Engine and impacts customer CUST-0009. @eid_b7702c98, can you take a look at this?", "utterranceID": "20261016-5-f8832"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261016-5-f8832"}

