{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianmiller-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-eb2433"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_af89b40b", "timestamp": "2027-02-17T02:24:00", "text": "Absolutely! Thanks for coordinating, Ian. Let's get to work! 💪", "utterranceID": "20270216-9-db64c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270216-9-db64c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianmiller-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-eb2433"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_af89b40b", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T07:31:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect action suggestions for non-English syntax has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ActionGenie/pull/50.", "utterranceID": "20270303-0-7f5dc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270303-0-7f5dc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianmiller-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-eb2433"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_af89b40b", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T07:36:00", "text": "The root cause was that our NLP model was heavily optimized for English syntax, which led to errors when it tried to process languages with different grammatical structures.", "utterranceID": "20270303-1-02801"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270303-1-02801"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianmiller-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-eb2433"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_af89b40b", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T07:39:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the language processing component to include a more flexible parsing mechanism that can adapt to various syntactic rules. This should improve the model's ability to handle non-English languages.", "utterranceID": "20270303-2-20c27"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270303-2-20c27"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianmiller-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-eb2433"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4bcfb482", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T07:43:00", "text": "Great work, Charlie! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. I'll test it with some non-English inputs to see how it performs now.", "utterranceID": "20270303-3-9bd0e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270303-3-9bd0e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianmiller-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-eb2433"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bed67c52", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T07:45:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_af89b40b! This should really help improve our international user experience. Let me know if you need any further testing from my side.", "utterranceID": "20270303-4-668e9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270303-4-668e9"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4afd9484", "timestamp": "2026-12-15T12:19:00", "text": "Great, Bob! Next, we have a Django issue called 'Improper Permission Checks on Admin Actions'. This one is about admin actions being executed without verifying user permissions, similar to our 'Improper Validation of User Permissions'. Here's the link: https://github.com/django/django/pull/15", "utterranceID": "20261215-3-c8210"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261215-3-c8210"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8175da95", "timestamp": "2026-12-15T12:21:00", "text": "This sounds like a perfect match for our permissions validation issue. I'll dive into their PR and see if there's anything we can leverage for our fix. Thanks for sharing, Emma! 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20261215-4-ed6f6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261215-4-ed6f6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4afd9484", "timestamp": "2026-12-15T12:23:00", "text": "Awesome, Fiona! Lastly, we have a TensorFlow issue titled 'Encoding Errors with UTF-8 Text'. Their models are failing to process UTF-8 encoded text correctly, which is similar to our 'Encoding Issues with Non-Latin Scripts'. Here's the link: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/16", "utterranceID": "20261215-5-7205c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261215-5-7205c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_21de287d", "timestamp": "2026-12-15T12:24:00", "text": "Thanks, Emma! I'll take a look at how TensorFlow is handling their encoding issues. It might give us some insights into fixing our NLP Model & Language Processing problems. 🌐", "utterranceID": "20261215-6-06591"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261215-6-06591"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4afd9484", "timestamp": "2026-12-15T12:25:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep these open-source solutions in mind as we work on our fixes. Feel free to reach out if you need any more info or help. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261215-7-f392b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261215-7-f392b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d67508f1", "timestamp": "2026-12-15T12:29:00", "text": "Will do! I'll update once I have more details on the unauthorized access issue. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261215-8-6a676"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261215-8-6a676"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8175da95", "timestamp": "2026-12-15T12:32:00", "text": "Same here, I'll keep you posted on the permissions issue. 👌", "utterranceID": "20261215-9-2a7be"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261215-9-2a7be"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_21de287d", "timestamp": "2026-12-15T12:34:00", "text": "I'll make sure to provide updates on the encoding fix as well. Thanks, team! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261215-10-a3ec9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261215-10-a3ec9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d5888f27", "timestamp": "2026-12-18T00:11:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Memory Leak in Task Processing Module' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ActionGenie/pull/36.", "utterranceID": "20261217-0-cbb69"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-0-cbb69"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4afd9484", "timestamp": "2026-12-18T00:16:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_d5888f27! Can you explain what was causing the memory leak?", "utterranceID": "20261217-1-396e0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-1-396e0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d5888f27", "timestamp": "2026-12-18T00:19:00", "text": "Sure, Emma. The root cause was improper memory management in the task processing module. Specifically, memory allocated for task data wasn't being released after the tasks were processed, which led to a gradual increase in memory usage and system slowdown.", "utterranceID": "20261217-2-5264b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-2-5264b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d1169926", "timestamp": "2026-12-18T00:24:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Bob Miller. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261217-3-eb411"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-3-eb411"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d5888f27", "timestamp": "2026-12-18T00:26:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I implemented a more efficient memory management strategy. I added a garbage collection routine that ensures memory is properly released after each task is processed. This prevents the accumulation of unused memory and keeps the system running smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20261217-4-c2b8e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-4-c2b8e"}

