{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianmiller-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-eb2433"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bed67c52", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T07:04:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ActionGenie that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261117-0-89800"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-0-89800"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianmiller-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-eb2433"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bed67c52", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T07:06:00", "text": "First up, we have a bug titled 'Duplicate Log Entries for Manual Actions'. This is affecting our Database Management & Logging System. Users and admins are facing challenges in auditing past actions, which is causing accountability issues. This is impacting customer CUST-0047. @eid_0ac476e4, this one's for you!", "utterranceID": "20261117-1-a77c3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-1-a77c3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianmiller-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-eb2433"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0ac476e4", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T07:07:00", "text": "Got it! I'll start looking into the duplicate log entries issue right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261117-2-822c6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-2-822c6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianmiller-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-eb2433"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bed67c52", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T07:12:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Inefficient Database Query Optimization'. This is causing slow response times in Backend Processing & Task Queue Management, leading to frustration for users, especially in fast-paced environments. Customer CUST-0108 is affected. @eid_4bcfb482, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261117-3-06935"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-3-06935"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianmiller-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-eb2433"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4bcfb482", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T07:17:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the database queries and see how we can optimize them for better performance. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261117-4-7d461"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-4-7d461"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianmiller-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-eb2433"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bed67c52", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T07:19:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, we have 'Missing Log Entries for Automated Actions'. This is also impacting our Database Management & Logging System, causing gaps in action history for users and admins. Customer CUST-0064 is affected. @eid_ae1d94d2, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20261117-5-40ff0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-5-40ff0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianmiller-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-eb2433"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ae1d94d2", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T07:24:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll investigate the missing log entries for automated actions and ensure we have a complete history. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20261117-6-85ea3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-6-85ea3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianmiller-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-eb2433"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bed67c52", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T07:25:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep communication open and update each other on progress. Feel free to ask questions or share insights as you work through these. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261117-7-cd249"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-7-cd249"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianmiller-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-eb2433"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0ac476e4", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T07:28:00", "text": "Will do! If anyone has insights on similar logging issues, feel free to share. 🤔", "utterranceID": "20261117-8-60a61"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-8-60a61"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianmiller-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-eb2433"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4bcfb482", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T07:31:00", "text": "Same here, any tips on query optimization are welcome! Let's make ActionGenie even better. 💪", "utterranceID": "20261117-9-95da4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-9-95da4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianmiller-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-eb2433"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ae1d94d2", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T07:36:00", "text": "Thanks, team! Looking forward to resolving these issues together. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261117-10-2a085"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-10-2a085"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-onForceX", "channelID": "ch-orcex-60b1fb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T14:50:00", "text": "@eid_fa6ec727 Good point, Fiona. They mention data anonymization, but it's not very detailed. We should keep an eye on how they address user privacy.", "utterranceID": "20260730-4-b8faf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260730-4-b8faf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-onForceX", "channelID": "ch-orcex-60b1fb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5890ce38", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T14:51:00", "text": "From a technical architecture perspective, their use of microservices for scalability is interesting. It allows them to deploy updates without downtime. We might want to consider something similar for our next iteration. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260730-5-d5d29"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260730-5-d5d29"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-onForceX", "channelID": "ch-orcex-60b1fb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5346d7a5", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T14:56:00", "text": "I noticed they have a comprehensive testing framework in place. It seems like a good model for ensuring reliability, especially with AI-driven features. @eid_fd8cecea, what do you think?", "utterranceID": "20260730-6-9b579"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260730-6-9b579"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-onForceX", "channelID": "ch-orcex-60b1fb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fd8cecea", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T14:58:00", "text": "Thanks for pointing that out, @eid_5346d7a5. Their approach to testing is thorough, but I think we can differentiate by focusing more on user feedback loops to refine our suggestions. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260730-7-a38c3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260730-7-a38c3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-onForceX", "channelID": "ch-orcex-60b1fb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bed67c52", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T15:03:00", "text": "Great insights, everyone! Let's compile these observations and see how we can leverage them to enhance our product. @eid_5890ce38, can you lead a session on microservices next week? 📅", "utterranceID": "20260730-8-7c501"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260730-8-7c501"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-onForceX", "channelID": "ch-orcex-60b1fb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5890ce38", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T15:04:00", "text": "Sure thing, @eid_bed67c52! I'll prepare some materials and set up a time. Looking forward to it! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260730-9-cad90"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260730-9-cad90"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-onForceX", "channelID": "ch-orcex-60b1fb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T15:09:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_5890ce38! This was a productive discussion. Let's keep the momentum going! 💪", "utterranceID": "20260730-10-b0656"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260730-10-b0656"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T08:39:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I implemented a robust rate limiting mechanism using a token bucket algorithm. This ensures that each endpoint now has a strict limit on the number of requests that can be made in a given timeframe, effectively mitigating the risk of brute force attacks.", "utterranceID": "20261201-4-4d000"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-4-4d000"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_443fee06", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T08:40:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid solution. Thanks for handling this so promptly, David!", "utterranceID": "20261201-5-851ac"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-5-851ac"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T08:43:00", "text": "Agreed, nice work! Let us know if there's anything else we need to do on our end.", "utterranceID": "20261201-6-e3b3a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-6-e3b3a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T08:45:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_802e8eff and @eid_443fee06. No further action is needed from you guys at the moment. I'll keep monitoring the endpoints to ensure everything runs smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20261201-7-679da"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-7-679da"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-12-09T14:33:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Blocking JavaScript Execution in ActionGenie' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ActionGenie/pull/34.", "utterranceID": "20261209-0-5e084"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261209-0-5e084"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-12-09T14:35:00", "text": "The root cause was that heavy computational tasks were being executed on the main thread without yielding. This blocked the UI thread, causing the interface to freeze when ActionGenie executed complex JavaScript logic.", "utterranceID": "20261209-1-1cb12"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261209-1-1cb12"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-12-09T14:37:00", "text": "To fix this, I refactored the code to offload these heavy tasks to a Web Worker. This allows the main thread to remain responsive, preventing the UI from freezing. Let me know if you have any questions!", "utterranceID": "20261209-2-f233e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261209-2-f233e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_443fee06", "timestamp": "2026-12-09T14:38:00", "text": "Great work, David! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. I'll test it out and let you know if I encounter any issues.", "utterranceID": "20261209-3-5e533"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261209-3-5e533"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-12-09T14:40:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_fc4619fa! Moving the tasks to a Web Worker sounds like a solid solution. I'll also take a look and run some tests on my end.", "utterranceID": "20261209-4-12ea7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261209-4-12ea7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-12-09T14:41:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_443fee06 and Charlie. I appreciate your help with testing. Let me know if anything comes up!", "utterranceID": "20261209-5-814a4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261209-5-814a4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_443fee06", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T00:04:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect suggestions for regional dialects in ActionGenie has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ActionGenie/pull/35.", "utterranceID": "20261210-0-e4709"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-0-e4709"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T00:07:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_443fee06! Can you explain what was causing the issue?", "utterranceID": "20261210-1-a93ed"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-1-a93ed"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_443fee06", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T00:09:00", "text": "Sure, Charlie. The root cause was that our NLP model didn't have enough training data for regional dialects and less common languages. This led to poor understanding and inaccurate action suggestions.", "utterranceID": "20261210-2-f3dbd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-2-f3dbd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T00:11:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, David G. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261210-3-a9410"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-3-a9410"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-SmartActionsforSlack", "channelID": "ch-slack-ba7231"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1f678d18", "timestamp": "2026-06-20T19:25:00", "text": "Hi team, I want to discuss the Product Requirements Document for SmartActionsforSlack. Let's brainstorm some ideas and outline what we need to include. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260620-0-85bda"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260620-0-85bda"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-SmartActionsforSlack", "channelID": "ch-slack-ba7231"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2026-06-20T19:29:00", "text": "Sounds good, David! I think we should start with defining the core features of the AI-driven actions. What do you think, @eid_95f6d01c?", "utterranceID": "20260620-1-d27d5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260620-1-d27d5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-SmartActionsforSlack", "channelID": "ch-slack-ba7231"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_95f6d01c", "timestamp": "2026-06-20T19:31:00", "text": "Absolutely, @eid_f4f58faa. We should focus on how the AI will identify relevant actions and the types of tasks it can automate. Maybe we can list some examples?", "utterranceID": "20260620-2-9f136"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260620-2-9f136"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-SmartActionsforSlack", "channelID": "ch-slack-ba7231"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_320cd970", "timestamp": "2026-06-20T19:36:00", "text": "I agree. Also, we need to consider how we'll test these features. Ensuring the AI suggestions are accurate is crucial. @eid_6039d1c9, any thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20260620-3-fe19e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260620-3-fe19e"}
