{"Channel": {"name": "planning-onForceX", "channelID": "ch-orcex-60b1fb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fd8cecea", "timestamp": "2026-06-18T07:29:00", "text": "Thanks for the insights, team! I'll incorporate a timeline in the Go-to-Market Strategy and a contingency plan in the Challenges section. I'll also add a user feedback loop in the Key Features. I'll update the document and share it for a final review by the end of the week. Appreciate all your input! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260618-8-1b938"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260618-8-1b938"}
