{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-35b4b2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_36569bb7", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T15:29:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Network Latency in Data Fetching' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/AutoTuneForce/pull/40.", "utterranceID": "20261101-0-1c26f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261101-0-1c26f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-35b4b2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_04a698e5", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T15:31:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_36569bb7! Can you explain what was causing the latency issue?", "utterranceID": "20261101-1-33ed1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261101-1-33ed1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-35b4b2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_36569bb7", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T15:33:00", "text": "Sure, George. The root cause was suboptimal network routing and a lack of redundancy in our data fetching paths, which led to increased latency.", "utterranceID": "20261101-2-181db"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261101-2-181db"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-35b4b2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_35e32fec", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T15:36:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Julia. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261101-3-72c31"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261101-3-72c31"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-35b4b2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_36569bb7", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T15:41:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I optimized the network routing by implementing a more efficient path selection algorithm. Additionally, I added redundancy to the data fetching paths to ensure that if one path is slow, others can compensate. This significantly reduced the latency.", "utterranceID": "20261101-4-7b72b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261101-4-7b72b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-35b4b2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6a0f49ba", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T15:44:00", "text": "Awesome work, Julia! This should really help with the model tuning process.", "utterranceID": "20261101-5-146f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261101-5-146f5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-35b4b2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_36569bb7", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T15:48:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_6a0f49ba! Let me know if you notice any further issues. I'm here to help.", "utterranceID": "20261101-6-89d5e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261101-6-89d5e"}

