{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T00:32:00", "text": "Awesome! Let's keep these open-source solutions in mind as we work through our issues. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or want to discuss further. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270105-7-cce92"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270105-7-cce92"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67f8a879", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T00:33:00", "text": "Will do! I'll update once I have more details from the Kafka PR. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270105-8-6faeb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270105-8-6faeb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1fd8457f", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T00:37:00", "text": "Same here, I'll keep you posted on my progress with the TensorFlow insights. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20270105-9-eaef8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270105-9-eaef8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T00:41:00", "text": "Thanks, team! I'll make sure to loop you in with any updates from the Node.js PR. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270105-10-ca16e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270105-10-ca16e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T05:06:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the 'Insufficient Input Validation in Parameter API'.", "utterranceID": "20270106-0-dff1d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-0-dff1d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T05:07:00", "text": "The concern was that the Parameter Adjustment Module's API doesn't adequately validate input data, potentially allowing malicious payloads to alter model parameters.", "utterranceID": "20270106-1-20e6c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-1-20e6c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T05:10:00", "text": "After reviewing the code and testing the API, I found that the current behavior is actually expected and by design.", "utterranceID": "20270106-2-006d5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-2-006d5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1fd8457f", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T05:12:00", "text": "Could you elaborate on why it's expected, David?", "utterranceID": "20270106-3-4408a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-3-4408a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T05:13:00", "text": "Sure, Fiona. The API is designed to be used in a controlled environment where input data is already sanitized by upstream processes.", "utterranceID": "20270106-4-ed0d4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-4-ed0d4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T05:17:00", "text": "So, it's more about ensuring the upstream processes are robust, right?", "utterranceID": "20270106-5-3af6d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-5-3af6d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T05:21:00", "text": "Exactly, @eid_b67edbb4. The API assumes that input validation has been handled before data reaches it. This is part of our layered security approach.", "utterranceID": "20270106-6-97e9f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-6-97e9f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67f8a879", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T05:23:00", "text": "Did you find any instances where this assumption might not hold?", "utterranceID": "20270106-7-d697b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-7-d697b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T05:24:00", "text": "No, Bob. I checked the integration points, and they all have proper validation in place. I also ran some tests to confirm this.", "utterranceID": "20270106-8-90cb6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-8-90cb6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1fd8457f", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T05:28:00", "text": "Thanks for clarifying, David. So, no changes needed on the API side?", "utterranceID": "20270106-9-5f3d8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-9-5f3d8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T05:33:00", "text": "That's correct, Fiona. No changes are needed. I'll document this in our bug tracking system to close the loop.", "utterranceID": "20270106-10-a8adc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-10-a8adc"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-30T15:56:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Delayed Parameter Update Feedback' issue. Users are experiencing delays in feedback after adjusting model parameters, which is causing confusion. This affects the User Interface and impacts customer CUST-0084. @eid_e81cfe3f, can you handle this one? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20261130-3-d376b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261130-3-d376b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2026-11-30T15:58:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll check out the UI feedback loop and see what's causing the delay. Let's get this sorted for CUST-0084. 💪", "utterranceID": "20261130-4-17c8f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261130-4-17c8f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-30T16:01:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's an 'Inconsistent Parameter Display' issue. The parameter values on the UI don't match what's being used by the optimization engine. This also affects the User Interface and impacts customer CUST-0100. @eid_67f8a879, can you take this one? 🤓", "utterranceID": "20261130-5-9cea5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261130-5-9cea5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67f8a879", "timestamp": "2026-11-30T16:04:00", "text": "On it! I'll investigate the parameter display issue and make sure the UI reflects the correct values. Thanks for assigning it to me! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261130-6-afa5f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261130-6-afa5f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-30T16:06:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep communication open and update each other on progress. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or additional info. Let's get these issues resolved for our customers! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261130-7-1e094"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261130-7-1e094"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1fd8457f", "timestamp": "2026-11-30T16:11:00", "text": "Will do! I'll keep you posted on the latency fix. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20261130-8-8cb1c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261130-8-8cb1c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2026-11-30T16:12:00", "text": "Same here, I'll update once I have more info on the feedback delay. 🕵️‍♂️", "utterranceID": "20261130-9-5c58e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261130-9-5c58e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67f8a879", "timestamp": "2026-11-30T16:14:00", "text": "I'll share updates on the parameter display as soon as I have them. Thanks, team! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261130-10-5566f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261130-10-5566f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-12-03T03:28:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might help us with our current Salesforce issues. Let's take a look and see what we can learn! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261202-0-82365"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261202-0-82365"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-12-03T03:32:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Producer Latency Spike' issue in Apache Kafka. It's causing high latency in message production, leading to outdated data being processed in real-time analytics. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/842. @eid_1fd8457f, this seems similar to our 'Data Stream Latency Misalignment' issue. What do you think? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20261202-1-a9ce0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261202-1-a9ce0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1fd8457f", "timestamp": "2026-12-03T03:37:00", "text": "Absolutely, David! The latency spike in Kafka is quite similar to what we're seeing with our Backend Optimization Engine. I'll dive into their PR to see how they tackled it and see if we can apply any of their solutions. Thanks for pointing this out! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261202-2-d73b9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261202-2-d73b9"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-aa8bc4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e9652ef0", "timestamp": "2026-11-19T13:20:00", "text": "Sure, Ian. The root cause was a mismatch in time zone settings between the application server and the database server. This led to incorrect timestamp entries in the training logs.", "utterranceID": "20261119-2-bc029"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-2-bc029"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-aa8bc4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e1bcb754", "timestamp": "2026-11-19T13:21:00", "text": "Thanks for the clarification, George. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261119-3-25322"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-3-25322"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-aa8bc4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e9652ef0", "timestamp": "2026-11-19T13:24:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I synchronized the time zone settings across both the application and database servers. Additionally, I added a configuration check during the application startup to ensure that the time zones remain consistent in the future.", "utterranceID": "20261119-4-84122"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-4-84122"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-aa8bc4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-11-19T13:26:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid fix. Thanks for handling this so quickly, George!", "utterranceID": "20261119-5-f82fd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-5-f82fd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-aa8bc4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e9652ef0", "timestamp": "2026-11-19T13:27:00", "text": "No problem, @eid_6f719d21. Let me know if you notice any other issues.", "utterranceID": "20261119-6-8c109"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-6-8c109"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-aa8bc4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e1bcb754", "timestamp": "2026-11-19T13:31:00", "text": "Will do. Thanks again, George!", "utterranceID": "20261119-7-076df"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-7-076df"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-aa8bc4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:06:00", "text": "Hi team, the customer has reopened the 'Inconsistent Timestamp Logging' bug. It seems the issue has resurfaced. 😕", "utterranceID": "20261120-0-8a869"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261120-0-8a869"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-aa8bc4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e9652ef0", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:09:00", "text": "Oh no, that's unexpected! I thought we had it resolved. I'll take a look at it right away. @eid_6f719d21, do we have any new details from the customer?", "utterranceID": "20261120-1-3f315"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261120-1-3f315"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-aa8bc4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:13:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_e9652ef0. The customer mentioned that the timestamps are still inconsistent, especially during peak training times. They noticed this while auditing recent logs. @George Smith, could you prioritize this?", "utterranceID": "20261120-2-ef08e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261120-2-ef08e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-aa8bc4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e9652ef0", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:14:00", "text": "Got it, Ian. I'll dive into the logs and see what's going on. If anyone has noticed anything unusual or has suggestions, feel free to chime in. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20261120-3-21df1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261120-3-21df1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-aa8bc4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e1bcb754", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:16:00", "text": "I can help review the logs too, @George Smith. Maybe there's something we missed in the initial fix. Let's sync up later today?", "utterranceID": "20261120-4-d343a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261120-4-d343a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-aa8bc4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e9652ef0", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:20:00", "text": "Sounds good, @Ian Smith. I'll gather some data and we can meet at 3 PM. Hopefully, we can get to the bottom of this quickly. 🤞", "utterranceID": "20261120-5-1bcf9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261120-5-1bcf9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-aa8bc4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T18:25:00", "text": "Thanks, team! Let's aim to resolve this ASAP. Let me know if you need any additional info from the customer. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261120-6-da896"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261120-6-da896"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-aa8bc4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e9652ef0", "timestamp": "2026-11-25T17:59:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Data Corruption in Model Training Logs' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/AutoTuneForce/pull/43.", "utterranceID": "20261125-0-24368"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261125-0-24368"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-aa8bc4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-11-25T18:04:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_e9652ef0! Can you explain what was causing the corruption?", "utterranceID": "20261125-1-c02f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261125-1-c02f5"}

