{"title": "Fix SHAP Value Calculation for Accurate Feature Attribution", "summary": "This pull request addresses the issue of inaccurate feature attribution scores provided by ExplainabilityForce. The root cause was identified as a bug in the SHAP value calculation algorithm, which did not handle certain edge cases in the data distribution correctly. 

