{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8a3b36d4", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T22:11:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'OAuth Token Leakage' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ForecastForce/pull/39.", "utterranceID": "20261129-0-9e2e5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261129-0-9e2e5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8a3b36d4", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T22:13:00", "text": "The root cause was that our authentication module was improperly handling OAuth token storage and transmission. It was exposing tokens in URL query parameters instead of using secure methods like HTTP headers.", "utterranceID": "20261129-1-61c31"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261129-1-61c31"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T22:17:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_8a3b36d4! How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261129-2-c3036"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261129-2-c3036"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8a3b36d4", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T22:22:00", "text": "Thanks, George! I updated the authentication module to store OAuth tokens securely in session storage and ensured they are transmitted using HTTP headers instead of query parameters. This should prevent any potential interception.", "utterranceID": "20261129-3-102fe"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261129-3-102fe"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_dbc6178f", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T22:23:00", "text": "Nice work, Alice! This should significantly improve our security posture.", "utterranceID": "20261129-4-f6ec4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261129-4-f6ec4"}
