{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-11-07T07:23:00", "text": "Thanks, Hannah. I'll update the documentation to highlight the importance of consistent data inputs.", "utterranceID": "20261106-10-75c78"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261106-10-75c78"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d9f2150", "timestamp": "2026-11-07T07:26:00", "text": "Great, thanks everyone! Let me know if there's anything else you need from my side.", "utterranceID": "20261106-11-a62c0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261106-11-a62c0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_57e922c4", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T03:10:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Suboptimal Data Caching Strategy' has been resolved. 🎉", "utterranceID": "20261120-0-ba400"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261120-0-ba400"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_57e922c4", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T03:11:00", "text": "The issue was that our current caching mechanism wasn't prioritizing frequently accessed data, which led to repeated data fetching and slow visualization updates.", "utterranceID": "20261120-1-63d77"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261120-1-63d77"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_57e922c4", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T03:12:00", "text": "I've implemented a fix by introducing a Least Recently Used (LRU) caching strategy. This ensures that the most frequently accessed data is prioritized, reducing unnecessary data retrieval operations and improving latency.", "utterranceID": "20261120-2-a4027"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261120-2-a4027"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_57e922c4", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T03:13:00", "text": "You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ForecastForce/pull/38", "utterranceID": "20261120-3-3977c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261120-3-3977c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d9f2150", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T03:15:00", "text": "Great work, Alice! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. I'll test it out and see how it performs with the large datasets.", "utterranceID": "20261120-4-be03d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261120-4-be03d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T03:17:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_57e922c4! The LRU caching strategy sounds like a solid improvement. Let me know if you need any help with further testing.", "utterranceID": "20261120-5-0d164"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261120-5-0d164"}
