{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2027-02-11T12:02:00", "text": "First up, we have a UI Overlap issue in React Native. The components overlap or get cut off on smaller screens, affecting user navigation. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/facebook/react-native/pull/408. @eid_dd1ff0ca, this seems similar to the UI rendering issue you're tackling. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20270211-1-b5977"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270211-1-b5977"}
