{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0deececb", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T11:49:00", "text": "Great find, George! I'll dive into the PostgreSQL PR and see how they addressed the replication lag. It could definitely help us with our Database Management & Data Synchronization problem. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20261226-4-8d713"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-4-8d713"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T11:54:00", "text": "Lastly, there's a 'Cache Invalidation Bug' in Redis. They're facing stale data issues due to improper cache invalidation, similar to what we're seeing. Here's the link: https://github.com/redis/redis/pull/390. Emma Smith, this might be right up your alley! 🤓", "utterranceID": "20261226-5-a020e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-5-a020e"}
