{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T09:34:00", "text": "First, there's a bug in Apache Kafka titled 'Data Loss Due to Race Condition in Log Segment'. It seems similar to our 'Feedback Data Overwrite Due to Race Condition'. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/992. @eid_9307fe85, what do you think?", "utterranceID": "20261121-1-32ee7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261121-1-32ee7"}
