{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T03:57:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SentimentForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260819-0-c3acd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-0-c3acd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T03:58:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Connection Pool Exhaustion' issue. The database connection pool is frequently exhausted, causing delays in establishing new connections for sentiment data retrieval. This affects the Database Management System and is impacting Customer CUST-0034. @eid_6cc1a0f6, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20260819-1-367b5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-1-367b5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T04:03:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll look into the connection pool configuration and see what's causing the exhaustion. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260819-2-de8ee"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-2-de8ee"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T04:08:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Stale Sentiment Cache Issue'. The sentiment analysis results are being served from an outdated cache, which affects the Real-Time Dashboard & Backend Server. This is impacting Customer CUST-0006. @eid_4cede092, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20260819-3-b86ca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-3-b86ca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T04:12:00", "text": "Got it! I'll investigate the caching mechanism and ensure the dashboard reflects real-time data. Thanks for assigning this to me! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260819-4-25da5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-4-25da5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T04:15:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's a 'Negation Handling Error in Sentiment Parsing'. The sentiment analysis engine isn't correctly interpreting negations, leading to incorrect sentiment scores. This affects the Sentiment Analysis Engine and is also impacting Customer CUST-0034. @eid_6cc1a0f6, can you take this one as well?", "utterranceID": "20260819-5-2ec27"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-5-2ec27"}
