{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicetaylor-MonitorForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ef125"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_be46b656", "timestamp": "2026-08-01T20:52:00", "text": "Absolutely, Alice. I'll dive into their PR to see how they're addressing the time zone discrepancies. It might give us some insights into refining our approach. Thanks for sharing! 🔍", "utterranceID": "20260801-4-99656"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260801-4-99656"}

