{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-21T13:36:00", "text": "No problem, happy to help! Let me know if you notice any other issues.", "utterranceID": "20261221-7-64aef"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261221-7-64aef"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-25T00:54:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Suboptimal Data Caching Strategy' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/50.", "utterranceID": "20261224-0-3c8cb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-0-3c8cb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-25T00:57:00", "text": "The root cause was an inadequate cache size and improper cache invalidation policies, which led to frequent cache misses and increased database load for sentiment data queries.", "utterranceID": "20261224-1-b7d89"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-1-b7d89"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-25T00:58:00", "text": "To fix this, I increased the cache size and implemented a more efficient cache invalidation strategy. This should significantly reduce the number of cache misses and alleviate the database load.", "utterranceID": "20261224-2-62b27"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-2-62b27"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-25T01:01:00", "text": "Great work, Ian! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. The new caching strategy should help improve our system's performance.", "utterranceID": "20261224-3-ab5fb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-3-ab5fb"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T00:37:00", "text": "To fix this, I increased the connection pool size and implemented a connection reuse strategy that efficiently manages idle connections. This should prevent the pool from being exhausted during peak loads.", "utterranceID": "20260825-2-19303"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-2-19303"}
