{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0a044a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e1bcb754", "timestamp": "2027-01-10T22:45:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Database Deadlock During Concurrent Feedback Processing' has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/FeedbackForce/pull/40.", "utterranceID": "20270110-0-091a8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270110-0-091a8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0a044a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2027-01-10T22:50:00", "text": "Great news, Ian! Can you explain what was causing the deadlocks?", "utterranceID": "20270110-1-6aaf4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270110-1-6aaf4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0a044a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e1bcb754", "timestamp": "2027-01-10T22:54:00", "text": "Sure, Ian. The root cause was improper transaction management and locking mechanisms in our database layer. We were not handling concurrent transactions efficiently, which led to deadlocks when multiple feedback entries were processed simultaneously.", "utterranceID": "20270110-2-2e19c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270110-2-2e19c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0a044a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e9652ef0", "timestamp": "2027-01-10T22:56:00", "text": "Thanks for the explanation, Ian. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270110-3-f4fbe"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270110-3-f4fbe"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0a044a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e1bcb754", "timestamp": "2027-01-10T23:00:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I implemented a more granular locking strategy and optimized the transaction management. This involved adjusting the isolation levels and ensuring that locks are held for the shortest duration necessary. Additionally, I added retry logic to handle any potential deadlocks gracefully.", "utterranceID": "20270110-4-f7545"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270110-4-f7545"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0a044a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2027-01-10T23:04:00", "text": "Sounds like a solid fix. Thanks for taking care of this, Ian!", "utterranceID": "20270110-5-fc93a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270110-5-fc93a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0a044a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e9652ef0", "timestamp": "2027-01-10T23:05:00", "text": "Agreed, thanks Ian. I'll keep an eye on the feedback processing to ensure everything runs smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20270110-6-325ac"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270110-6-325ac"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0a044a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e1bcb754", "timestamp": "2027-01-10T23:06:00", "text": "Thanks, George. Let me know if you notice any further issues. I'm here to help!", "utterranceID": "20270110-7-60851"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270110-7-60851"}

