{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2027-01-04T14:50:00", "text": "First up, we have a Concurrency Issue in Data Stream Processing. The Data Ingestion API is struggling with concurrent data streams, causing bottlenecks and delays. This is impacting CUST-0082, as their model updates are slower, leading to outdated predictions. @eid_67f8a879, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20270104-1-f5599"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270104-1-f5599"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67f8a879", "timestamp": "2027-01-04T14:54:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the Data Ingestion API and see what's causing the bottlenecks. Thanks for the heads-up! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270104-2-67871"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270104-2-67871"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-aa8bc4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e9652ef0", "timestamp": "2026-11-19T13:20:00", "text": "Sure, Ian. The root cause was a mismatch in time zone settings between the application server and the database server. This led to incorrect timestamp entries in the training logs.", "utterranceID": "20261119-2-bc029"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-2-bc029"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-aa8bc4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e1bcb754", "timestamp": "2026-11-19T13:21:00", "text": "Thanks for the clarification, George. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261119-3-25322"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-3-25322"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-aa8bc4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e9652ef0", "timestamp": "2026-11-19T13:24:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I synchronized the time zone settings across both the application and database servers. Additionally, I added a configuration check during the application startup to ensure that the time zones remain consistent in the future.", "utterranceID": "20261119-4-84122"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-4-84122"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-aa8bc4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-11-19T13:26:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid fix. Thanks for handling this so quickly, George!", "utterranceID": "20261119-5-f82fd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-5-f82fd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-aa8bc4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e9652ef0", "timestamp": "2026-11-19T13:27:00", "text": "No problem, @eid_6f719d21. Let me know if you notice any other issues.", "utterranceID": "20261119-6-8c109"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-6-8c109"}
