{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2027-01-05T15:32:00", "text": "Got it, I'll look into the 'Incorrect Scope Assignment' issue. I'll start by reviewing the authentication process and see where the scope assignments are going wrong. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270105-2-59de9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270105-2-59de9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-05T15:34:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_5782059f! Next, we have a security concern: 'Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) in Data Insights'. Malicious scripts can be injected into the contextual insights, which could lead to unauthorized access to user data. This affects the Data Transmission & Security Layer and is impacting customer CUST-0108. @eid_b4d260c1, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20270105-3-dec25"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270105-3-dec25"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b4d260c1", "timestamp": "2027-01-05T15:36:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll prioritize the XSS issue. I'll start by reviewing our data transmission protocols and security measures. Thanks for assigning this to me! 🔍", "utterranceID": "20270105-4-82133"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270105-4-82133"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-05T15:40:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Lastly, we have 'Incorrect Feature Weighting'. The AI is assigning incorrect weights to user behavior features, which is skewing the analysis and resulting in non-personalized insights. This affects the AI Analysis Engine and is impacting customer CUST-0016. @eid_b4d260c1, since you're already familiar with the AI engine, could you also take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270105-5-131e3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270105-5-131e3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b4d260c1", "timestamp": "2027-01-05T15:45:00", "text": "Sure thing, I'll dive into the AI Analysis Engine and check the feature weighting logic. I'll make sure to address both issues promptly. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270105-6-159f1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270105-6-159f1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-05T15:48:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone, for jumping on these issues so quickly! Let me know if you need any more details or support. Let's keep our customers happy! 😊", "utterranceID": "20270105-7-a9c14"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270105-7-a9c14"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2027-01-05T15:53:00", "text": "Will do! I'll keep you posted on the progress. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20270105-8-b511c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270105-8-b511c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b4d260c1", "timestamp": "2027-01-05T15:55:00", "text": "Same here, I'll update as I make progress on both issues. Thanks for coordinating, @eid_82e9fcef! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270105-9-6779a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270105-9-6779a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-08T22:36:00", "text": "Hi team, I found some interesting open-source bugs that might help us with our current issues. Let's take a look at them! 😊", "utterranceID": "20270108-0-8709b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270108-0-8709b"}
