{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T06:52:00", "text": "First up, there's a concurrency bottleneck in the PostgreSQL query planner. Similar to our ContextForce issue, queries are being executed sequentially, which increases response times under heavy load. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/postgres/postgres/pull/1951. @George, this might give us some insights for optimizing our query execution.", "utterranceID": "20261231-1-28226"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-1-28226"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T06:53:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian! I'll review the PostgreSQL PR and see if there are any strategies we can apply to our concurrency issue. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261231-2-6ab40"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-2-6ab40"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T06:54:00", "text": "Great! Next, we have a bug in TensorFlow related to model overfitting on limited datasets. This is quite similar to our AI model issue where it's overfitting to a narrow set of user behaviors. Here's the PR: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/1952. George, since you're already on the AI model, this might be useful for you too.", "utterranceID": "20261231-3-83853"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-3-83853"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T06:56:00", "text": "Perfect timing! I'll dive into the TensorFlow PR and see how they tackled the overfitting problem. Let's make our AI insights more robust! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261231-4-db0ca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-4-db0ca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T07:01:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks George! Lastly, there's a high latency issue in Grafana's dashboard data fetching, which is causing delays similar to what we're seeing with our API calls. Here's the PR: https://github.com/grafana/grafana/pull/1953. @Alice, this might be relevant for the latency issue you're working on.", "utterranceID": "20261231-5-83fd8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-5-83fd8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T07:05:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian! I'll check out the Grafana PR and see if there are any optimizations we can apply to reduce our API latency. Let's get those insights flowing smoothly again! 🔧", "utterranceID": "20261231-6-91d98"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-6-91d98"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T07:06:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep learning from these open-source projects and apply what we can to our own issues. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or want to discuss further. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261231-7-acd10"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-7-acd10"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T07:08:00", "text": "Will do! Thanks for pulling these together, Ian. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261231-8-37d3f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-8-37d3f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T07:10:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian! I'll keep you posted on any progress or findings. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261231-9-50b6b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-9-50b6b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-05T15:24:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ContextForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270105-0-8f665"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270105-0-8f665"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-05T15:27:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Incorrect Scope Assignment'. Third-party applications are unable to access certain insights due to incorrect scope assignments during the authentication process. This affects the API Authentication Module and is impacting customer CUST-0017. @eid_5782059f, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270105-1-0c741"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270105-1-0c741"}

{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-1c7f59"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b4d260c1", "timestamp": "2026-11-11T03:06:00", "text": "Sounds good, @eid_92c62291. Once those updates are in, I think we'll be in a much better place. Let us know when it's ready for another round of review. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261111-6-edb08"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261111-6-edb08"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-1c7f59"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2026-11-11T03:09:00", "text": "Looking forward to the updates, @eid_92c62291. Thanks for tackling this! It's a big step forward for our performance goals. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261111-7-7ab11"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261111-7-7ab11"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-1c7f59"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-11-11T03:14:00", "text": "Will do, @eid_b4d260c1 and @eid_01942cf0. Thanks for the quick review and helpful suggestions. I'll ping you once the changes are up. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261111-8-38d5c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261111-8-38d5c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-1c7f59"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:15:00", "text": "Hi team, please check my PR for 'Implement User Interaction Tracking for Model Refinement'. Here's the link: https://github.com/salesforce/extAIX/pull/11. I've developed a system to track and log user interactions with our analytics insights. This data will help refine our models and improve the relevance and accuracy of the insights. Let me know your thoughts! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261114-0-dce09"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-0-dce09"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-1c7f59"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:17:00", "text": "Thanks for sharing, @eid_ecaa9084! I'll take a look at it now. Excited to see how this will enhance our model refinement process. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20261114-1-c4ab2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-1-c4ab2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-1c7f59"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0f6b0aea", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:22:00", "text": "Hey @eid_ecaa9084, I'll review it too. Tracking user interactions sounds like a great step forward. Let's see how it all fits together. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261114-2-15f99"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-2-15f99"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-1c7f59"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:26:00", "text": "I've gone through the PR, and it looks like the user interactions are being tracked and logged accurately. Great job on that front, @eid_ecaa9084! 👏", "utterranceID": "20261114-3-36033"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-3-36033"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-1c7f59"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0f6b0aea", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:29:00", "text": "I agree with Alice, the tracking seems solid. However, I noticed that the interaction data format might need some adjustments to be more suitable for model training. It seems a bit too verbose, which could complicate the preprocessing steps. What do you think, @eid_ecaa9084?", "utterranceID": "20261114-4-e8741"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-4-e8741"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-1c7f59"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:33:00", "text": "Thanks for the feedback, Bob! I can see how the verbosity might be an issue. I'll look into optimizing the data format to make it more streamlined for model training. Any specific suggestions on how to improve it?", "utterranceID": "20261114-5-8a9e2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-5-8a9e2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-1c7f59"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:37:00", "text": "Also, I noticed a slight dip in performance when the tracking system is active. We might need to optimize that part to ensure it doesn't impact the user experience. Maybe some caching or asynchronous processing could help? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20261114-6-a4895"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-6-a4895"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-1c7f59"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:40:00", "text": "Good catch, Alice. I'll investigate the performance impact and see if we can implement some optimizations. Thanks for pointing that out! I'll make these changes and update the PR. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261114-7-9c83c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-7-9c83c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-1c7f59"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0f6b0aea", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T18:45:00", "text": "Sounds like a plan, @eid_ecaa9084. Looking forward to the updates. Let us know if you need any help with the optimizations. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261114-8-766a7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-8-766a7"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2542cff3", "timestamp": "2027-02-08T15:49:00", "text": "I updated the configuration to align the token expiry settings with our intended duration. This involved adjusting the expiry parameter in the API Authentication Module to ensure tokens last as expected. I also added a unit test to verify the correct expiry duration moving forward.", "utterranceID": "20270208-4-2bf52"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270208-4-2bf52"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2027-02-08T15:51:00", "text": "Nice work, David! Adding a unit test is a great idea to prevent this from happening again.", "utterranceID": "20270208-5-9f9bc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270208-5-9f9bc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-02-08T15:54:00", "text": "Agreed, well done! Let’s monitor the system for a few days to ensure everything is stable.", "utterranceID": "20270208-6-3bf89"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270208-6-3bf89"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2542cff3", "timestamp": "2027-02-08T15:57:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone. I'll keep an eye on the logs and report any anomalies. Let me know if you notice anything unusual.", "utterranceID": "20270208-7-09398"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270208-7-09398"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-02-10T19:24:00", "text": "Hi team, the customer has reopened the 'Token Expiry Mismatch' bug. It seems the issue with unexpected token expiry is still affecting CUST-0055. 😕", "utterranceID": "20270210-0-a7b1b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270210-0-a7b1b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2542cff3", "timestamp": "2027-02-10T19:28:00", "text": "Oh no, I thought we had that sorted! 😟 Let me take a look at the logs again. @George Miller, any chance there were changes in the third-party app integrations recently?", "utterranceID": "20270210-1-33dbe"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270210-1-33dbe"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-02-10T19:30:00", "text": "@David Taylor, not that I'm aware of, but I'll double-check with the integrations team. It might be worth revisiting the token management logic just in case. 🔄", "utterranceID": "20270210-2-51585"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270210-2-51585"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-02-10T19:31:00", "text": "Thanks, @George Miller. @David Taylor, can you take the lead on this again? Let's make sure we get to the bottom of it this time. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20270210-3-e43d8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270210-3-e43d8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2542cff3", "timestamp": "2027-02-10T19:32:00", "text": "Absolutely, @Julia Taylor. I'll dive into the code and see if there's anything we missed. If anyone has suggestions or insights, feel free to share. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270210-4-115f6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270210-4-115f6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2027-02-10T19:33:00", "text": "Thanks, David! Let us know if you need any help. I'll keep an eye on any updates from the customer side. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270210-5-bdfad"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270210-5-bdfad"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-02-10T19:35:00", "text": "Sounds like a plan. Let's aim to have an update by the end of the day. Thanks, everyone! 💪", "utterranceID": "20270210-6-e8c1f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270210-6-e8c1f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2027-02-12T05:00:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Session Hijacking Vulnerability' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ContextForce/pull/38.", "utterranceID": "20270212-0-d5641"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-0-d5641"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-02-12T05:04:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_ecaa9084! Could you explain what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20270212-1-742c7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-1-742c7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2027-02-12T05:09:00", "text": "Sure, George. The root cause was that session tokens were not being invalidated upon logout or after a certain period of inactivity. This made them vulnerable to reuse by attackers, allowing for session hijacking.", "utterranceID": "20270212-2-60233"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-2-60233"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2542cff3", "timestamp": "2027-02-12T05:13:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Julia. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270212-3-ea08e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-3-ea08e"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-02-08T04:09:00", "text": "Great! Next, there's a bug in TensorFlow called 'Model Drift in Training Pipeline'. The trained models are deviating from expected performance due to parameter drift, leading to inaccurate predictions. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/1972. Alice, this sounds a lot like our preference model drift issue. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20270207-3-b90ff"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270207-3-b90ff"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2027-02-08T04:13:00", "text": "Absolutely, Ian! This is very similar to what we're seeing. I'll dive into the TensorFlow PR to understand how they tackled the parameter drift. It might give us some ideas for stabilizing our model. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20270207-4-08351"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270207-4-08351"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-02-08T04:14:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks Alice! Lastly, there's a 'Memory Leak in Event Loop' issue in Node.js. Persistent memory leaks are causing server slowdowns, impacting response times for users. Here's the PR: https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/1973. Charlie, this seems to align with our memory leak in the data processing module. What do you think?", "utterranceID": "20270207-5-7ce1b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270207-5-7ce1b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2027-02-08T04:16:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian! This Node.js issue is definitely relevant. I'll look into their approach to resolving the memory leak and see if we can apply similar strategies. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20270207-6-ef41a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270207-6-ef41a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-02-08T04:19:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep these open-source solutions in mind as we work through our issues. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or want to discuss further. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270207-7-41043"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270207-7-41043"}
