{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_36319f22", "timestamp": "2026-09-14T17:47:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Product Vision Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. 😊 I've shared the document above. Let's start by discussing the AI misinterpretation issue.", "utterranceID": "20260914-0-8bbf0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260914-0-8bbf0"}
