{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2027-03-09T14:30:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_0f6b0aea! Thanks for getting this sorted out so quickly. This should really improve the accuracy of our insights.", "utterranceID": "20270309-3-dd797"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270309-3-dd797"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2027-03-09T14:34:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob! This was a critical issue, and I'm glad it's resolved. I'll keep an eye on the data to ensure everything is syncing correctly now.", "utterranceID": "20270309-4-7d515"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270309-4-7d515"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-03-09T14:36:00", "text": "Nice job, Bob. Let me know if there's anything else you need from the DevOps side to keep things running smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20270309-5-f007d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270309-5-f007d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0f6b0aea", "timestamp": "2027-03-09T14:38:00", "text": "Thanks, @Charlie Davis, @Alice Brown, and Ian! I'll monitor the system for a while to ensure stability. Appreciate the support from everyone.", "utterranceID": "20270309-6-eaaa3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270309-6-eaaa3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2027-03-13T08:25:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect AI model behavior titled 'Preference Model Drift' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ContextForce/pull/40.", "utterranceID": "20270313-0-40dae"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270313-0-40dae"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2027-03-13T08:26:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_92c62291! Can you explain what caused the drift?", "utterranceID": "20270313-1-54cdf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270313-1-54cdf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2027-03-13T08:27:00", "text": "Sure, Charlie. The root cause was that the AI model hadn't been retrained with recent data. Over time, this led to a drift in its understanding of user preferences, causing it to misinterpret behaviors.", "utterranceID": "20270313-2-5e6aa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270313-2-5e6aa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0f6b0aea", "timestamp": "2027-03-13T08:29:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Alice. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270313-3-c03b8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270313-3-c03b8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2027-03-13T08:31:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I retrained the model using the latest dataset, which realigned its parameters with current user preferences. Additionally, I've set up a schedule for regular retraining to prevent future drifts.", "utterranceID": "20270313-4-be9dd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270313-4-be9dd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-03-13T08:35:00", "text": "Nice work, @eid_92c62291! Regular retraining sounds like a solid plan. Thanks for handling this so swiftly.", "utterranceID": "20270313-5-238b4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270313-5-238b4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2027-03-13T08:36:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian! Let me know if you notice any more issues or have further questions.", "utterranceID": "20270313-6-7a6f4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270313-6-7a6f4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2027-03-13T08:38:00", "text": "Will do, Alice. Appreciate the quick turnaround on this!", "utterranceID": "20270313-7-ba78d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270313-7-ba78d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2027-03-25T13:28:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'API Authentication Failure' has been resolved. Third-party applications should now be able to authenticate with the ContextForce API without issues.", "utterranceID": "20270325-0-5bf20"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270325-0-5bf20"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2027-03-25T13:30:00", "text": "That's great news, @eid_5782059f! Could you share more details about what caused the issue?", "utterranceID": "20270325-1-c31cb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270325-1-c31cb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2027-03-25T13:33:00", "text": "Sure thing, Charlie. The root cause was a bug introduced in our recent update that affected the OAuth token validation process. Specifically, the update inadvertently altered the token parsing logic, causing it to reject valid tokens.", "utterranceID": "20270325-2-c9307"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270325-2-c9307"}

